# libretranslate
msgid "**DNS Plugin Installation:** Installs a matching plugin based on your configured ACME challenge method."
msgstr "**DNS plugina paigaldus:** Paigaldab sobiva plugina, mis põhineb teie seadistatud ACME väljakutse meetodil."

