msgid "**External drift monitoring.** Addon freshness is checked by opt-in external tests under `tests/external/update/addons/`. These tests are warn-only, emit GitHub Actions warning annotations, and are excluded from `make test` in the same way as Docker image and repository-ref external update checks."
