# libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO via SSO-proxy sidecar:** Gate the FusionDirectory web UI through the project's SSO-proxy sidecar (provided by `web-app-keycloak`) for OIDC-authenticated entry."
msgstr "**Native OIDC SSO- puhverserveri abil:** Gate the FusionDirectory web UI läbi projekti SSO-proxy külgkorvi (ette nähtud `web-app-keycloak`) OIDC autenditud kirje puhul."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO via SSO-proxy sidecar:** Gate the FusionDirectory web UI through the project’s SSO-proxy sidecar (provided by ``web-app-keycloak``) for OIDC-authenticated entry."
