# libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO:** Authenticate users against Keycloak via the in-role ``plg_system_keycloak`` plugin, with ``?fallback=local`` as an env-toggleable emergency hatch."
msgstr "**Native OIDC SSO:** Kasutajate autentimine Keycloaki vastu rollisisese ``plg_system_keycloak`` pluginaga ``?fallback=local`` ümberlülitatava avariiluugina."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO:** Authenticate users against Keycloak via the in-role `plg_system_keycloak` plugin, with `?fallback=local` as an env-toggleable emergency hatch."
msgstr "**Native OIDC SSO:** Kasutajate autentimine Keycloaki vastu rollisisese `plg_system_keycloak` pluginaga `?fallback=local` ümberlülitatava avariiluugina."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC SSO:** Semaphore renders its own \"Sign in with Keycloak\" button via `SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS`; the Keycloak client is auto-provisioned by `web-app-keycloak`."
msgstr "**Native OIDC SSO:** Semafor renderdab oma \"Logi sisse Keycloakiga\" nupp `SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS`; Keycloaki klienti varustab automaatselt `web-app-keycloak`."

