msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "**Native OIDC flavor** (`services.sso.flavor: oidc`), not the oauth2-proxy gate: OpenBao speaks OIDC itself, so it follows [`web-app-semaphore`](../../roles/web-app-semaphore/) rather than [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)."
msgstr "**Native OIDC maitse** (`services.sso.flavor: oidc`), mitte suud2-Proksi värav: OpenBao räägib OIDC-d ise, nii et see järgneb [`web-app-semaphore`](../../roles/web-app-semaphore/) pigem [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Native Prometheus metrics** via the `services.prometheus.native_metrics` + `templates/prometheus.yml.j2` contract already used by [`web-app-gitea`](../../roles/web-app-gitea/templates/prometheus.yml.j2), scraped on the internal container port over the role-local docker network."
msgstr "**Prometheuse mõõdikud** läbi `services.prometheus.native_metrics` + `templates/prometheus.yml.j2` juba kasutatav leping [`web-app-gitea`](../../roles/web-app-gitea/templates/prometheus.yml.j2), kraabitud sisemises konteinerpordis rolli-kohaliku sadamavõrgu kaudu."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Native in all editions** (incl. Raw): LDAP \"connections\" sync users, contact groups, roles."
msgstr "**Native kõigis väljaannetes** (sh. Toores): LDAP \"connections\" sünkroonige kasutajad, kontaktirühmad, rollid."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Native** local email/password login is *off* once OIDC is the login path (forces SSO), *on* otherwise — derived from the ``sso`` service flag. ``PENPOT_FLAGS`` renders ``enable-login-with-password`` / ``disable-login-with-password`` accordingly (no JS injection needed — Penpot disables the password form natively). When native login is on, the role bootstraps a local password for the ``administrator`` profile via the backend PREPL (``enable-prepl-server``) in ``tasks/main.yml`` — ``create-profile`` for a fresh profile, ``update-profile`` to set the password when a federated login already created it; the bootstrap is skipped under OIDC."
msgstr "**Native** kohalik e- posti/ parooli sisselogimine on *maha* kui OIDC on sisselogimise tee (SSO), *peal* muul juhul – tuletatud ``sso`` teenistuslipp. ``PENPOT_FLAGS`` renderdab ``enable-login-with-password`` / ``disable-login-with-password`` vastavalt (JS-i ei ole vaja süstida – Penpot keelab paroolivormi). Kui emakeelne sisselogimine on sisse lülitatud, käivitab roll kohaliku parooli ``administrator`` profiil taustaprogrammi PREPL kaudu (``enable-prepl-server``) sisse ``tasks/main.yml`` — ``create-profile`` värske profiili kohta, ``update-profile`` parooli määramiseks, kui alamkasutaja on selle juba loonud; alglaadimine jäetakse OIDC all vahele."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Native** local email/password login is *off* once OIDC is the login path (forces SSO), *on* otherwise — derived from the `sso` service flag. `PENPOT_FLAGS` renders `enable-login-with-password` / `disable-login-with-password` accordingly (no JS injection needed — Penpot disables the password form natively). When native login is on, the role bootstraps a local password for the `administrator` profile via the backend PREPL (`enable-prepl-server`) in `tasks/main.yml` — `create-profile` for a fresh profile, `update-profile` to set the password when a federated login already created it; the bootstrap is skipped under OIDC."
msgstr "**Native** kohalik e- posti/ parooli sisselogimine on *maha* kui OIDC on sisselogimise tee (SSO), *peal* muul juhul – tuletatud `sso` teenistuslipp. `PENPOT_FLAGS` renderdab `enable-login-with-password` / `disable-login-with-password` vastavalt (JS-i ei ole vaja süstida – Penpot keelab paroolivormi). Kui emakeelne sisselogimine on sisse lülitatud, käivitab roll kohaliku parooli `administrator` profiil taustaprogrammi PREPL kaudu (`enable-prepl-server`) sisse `tasks/main.yml` — `create-profile` värske profiili kohta, `update-profile` parooli määramiseks, kui alamkasutaja on selle juba loonud; alglaadimine jäetakse OIDC all vahele."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Navigate to Pixelfed Directory:** Once inside the container, navigate to the Pixelfed directory. This is typically the root directory where Pixelfed is installed."
msgstr "**Liikumine Pixelfed kataloogi:** Kui olete konteineris, navigeerige Pixelfedi kataloogi. See on tavaliselt juurkataloog, kuhu Pixelfed on paigaldatud."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Nested Docker state does not survive a teardown locally, but does in CI.** `INFINITO_DOCKER_VOLUME` is the named volume `docker` ([default.env](../../../../default.env)) and a host path (`/mnt/docker`) on GitHub. `compose down -v` removes a named volume and cannot remove a bind mount, so every workspace track starts on a clean inner daemon locally while CI carries the previous track's containers into the next one. Defects that need a container, network, or bind source to outlive a teardown cannot reproduce under act."
msgstr "**Nested Dockeri riik ei ela üle rebend kohalikul tasandil, vaid CI-s.** `INFINITO_DOCKER_VOLUME` on nimeline köide `docker` ([default.env](../../../../default.env)) peremeestee (`/mnt/docker`) GitHubil. `compose down -v` eemaldab nimelise helitugevuse ja ei saa eemaldada sidumiskinnitust, nii et iga tööruumi rada algab puhtal sisemisel deemonil kohapeal, samas kui CI kannab eelmise raja konteinerid järgmisesse. Defektid, mis vajavad konteinerit, võrku või seovad allikat, et elada kauem kui rebimine, ei saa teo all reprodutseerida."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Nested keys.** Both flat and nested credential keys are accepted, so e.g. `recaptcha.key` and `recaptcha.secret` remain nested."
msgstr "**Pesavõtmed.** Aktsepteeritakse nii lamedaid kui ka pesitsevaid usaldusvõtmeid, nt `recaptcha.key` ja `recaptcha.secret` pesitsema."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Network Configuration**: Includes setup of a dedicated Docker network for MariaDB."
msgstr "**Võrgu seadistamine**: Sisaldab spetsiaalse Dockeri võrgu loomist MariaDB jaoks."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Network bridges are addons.** Appservice / network bridges (e.g. the Matrix `mautrix` bridges to WhatsApp, Telegram, Signal, Slack, Facebook, Instagram) are addons declared under `meta/addons/` with `mechanism: bridge`, one file per bridged network. Each bridge owns its credentials in [`meta/secrets.yml`](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) and is `required: false` and disabled by default. The role's former bridge declarations (e.g. `web-app-matrix`'s `vars/bridges.yml`) are absorbed into `meta/addons/`."
msgstr "**Võrgusillad on lisandid.** Rakendusteenindus/ võrgusillad (nt Matrix `mautrix` WhatsApp, Telegram, Signal, Slack, Facebook, Instagram) on vastavalt `meta/addons/` koos `mechanism: bridge`, üks fail sildvõrgu kohta. Iga sild omab oma volitusi [`meta/secrets.yml`](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) ja `required: false` ja vaikimisi välja lülitatud. Rolli endised silddeklaratsioonid (nt. `web-app-matrix`'s `vars/bridges.yml`) imenduvad `meta/addons/`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**NetworkManager + dnsmasq**. preferred path when NetworkManager is active; configures the NM dnsmasq plugin with a wildcard zone entry."
msgstr "**NetworkManager + dnsmasq**. eelistatud asukoht, kui NetworkManager on aktiivne; seadistab NM dnsmasq plugina metamärgi tsooni kirjega."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Networks.** For `implementation: sidecar` or `external`, the MCP container MUST attach to the role's existing `networks.local` subnet and MUST NOT introduce a new top-level network."
msgstr "**Võrgud.** For `implementation: sidecar` või `external`, MCP konteiner PEAB kinnituma rolli olemasolevale `networks.local` Subnet ja EI TOHI luua uut tipptasemel võrku."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Neutral choice:** Unlike language‑specific collations, `unicode_ci` works robustly in multilingual contexts without bias."
msgstr "**Neutraalne valik:** Erinevalt keelepõhistest kollatsioonidest, `unicode_ci` töötab jõuliselt mitmekeelsetes kontekstides ilma eelarvamusteta."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Never a plain container, and the deploy proves it.** A preflight probes the host for `/dev/kvm` and for each runtime's binary, and selects the strongest runtime that is actually installed; the choice is logged at deploy time. It MUST NOT fall back to a plain `runc` container: unisolated execution of model-generated code is never allowed."
msgstr "**Mitte kunagi ei ole konteinerit ja selle kasutamine tõestab seda.** Lennueelne sond `/dev/kvm` ja iga käitusaja binaarversiooni jaoks ning valib kõige tugevama tegelikult installitud käitusaja; valik logitakse käivitusajal. See ei tohi langeda tagasi tasandikule `runc` konteiner: mudeli genereeritud koodi isoleerimata täitmine ei ole kunagi lubatud."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Never commit your API token to a public repository. Always keep it secure!**"
msgstr "**Ärge kunagi pange oma API-märki avalikku hoidlasse. Hoia seda alati turvaliselt!**"

# libretranslate
msgid "**Never disable.** Required by almost every app."
msgstr "**Ära kunagi keela.** Nõutav peaaegu iga rakenduse puhul."

msgid "**Never dispatch again while the watch is armed.** `entry-manual-steer.yml` declares the branch's concurrency group with `cancel-in-progress`, so a second dispatch cancels the run being triaged. The loop then triages a cancelled run and reports every unfinished row as a failure, which is a phantom: those rows never reached a verdict."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "**Never enable buffering for true WebSocket connections!**   Use `proxy_buffering off;` (as in `ws_generic.conf.j2`) or connections may fail."
msgstr "**Ärge kunagi lubage puhverdamist tõeliste WebSocketi ühenduste jaoks!** Kasuta `proxy_buffering off;` (nagu `ws_generic.conf.j2`) või ühendused võivad ebaõnnestuda."

# libretranslate
msgid "**New CLI capability:** Automatic resolution of *run_after* dependencies with safe cycle detection simplifies role analysis and automation."
msgstr "**CLI uus suutlikkus:** Automaatne lahutusvõime *run_after* Sõltuvus ohutu tsükli tuvastamisega lihtsustab rollianalüüsi ja automatiseerimist."

# libretranslate
msgid "**New and reshaped roles.** *sys-svc-nss* is split out of *sys-hostname*, *web-svc-mirror* serves frontend assets as a privacy proxy, PeerTube becomes clearnet-only, and roles that could not run were deleted rather than repaired. CLI tools install via pip instead of pkgmgr."
msgstr "**Uued ja ümberkujundatud rollid.** *sys-svc-nss* jaguneb *sys-hostname*, *web-svc-mirror* teenindab frontend varasid privaatsuse asendajana; PeerTube See muutub ainult selgeks võrguks ja rollid, mida ei saanud käivitada, kustutati, mitte parandati. CLI tööriistad installida pip asemel pkgmgr."

# libretranslate
msgid "**New lint contracts.** Port variables must resolve through lookups, scheduler services must declare *replicas: 1*, and volume-owning stack roles must declare their backup policy. *role_path* is forbidden in shell and command bodies. Deployment-mode defaults, container-inspection resolvers, asynchronous-task rationales and health-check declarations are validated centrally. Hadolint directives and documented *nocheck* exceptions are recognized instead of producing false positives."
msgstr "**Uued lepingud.** Porti muutujad peavad lahendama otsingute kaudu, planeerija teenused peavad deklareerima *koopiad: 1*ja mahtu omavad pinu rollid peavad deklareerima oma varundamispoliitika. *role_path* on keelatud kesta- ja juhtimisorganites. Kasutuselevõturežiimi vaikeväärtused, konteinerkontrollide lahendajad, asünkroonse ülesande põhjendused ja tervisekontrolli deklaratsioonid valideeritakse keskselt. Hadolinti direktiivid ja dokumenteeritud *nocheck* Erandeid tunnustatakse valepositiivsete tulemuste asemel."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Nginx** (frontend) — static assets + reverse proxy onto Frappe / SocketIO"
msgstr "**Nginx** (frontend) — staatiline vara + pöördproksi peale Frappe / SocketIO"

# libretranslate
msgid "**No Let's Encrypt for `.onion`** (ACME needs public DNS). Onion transport is already encrypted + server-authenticated (address = pubkey)."
msgstr "**Ei Krüpteerime `.onion`** (ACME vajab avalikku DNSi). Sibula transport on juba krüptitud + serveri autenditud (aadress = pubkey)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**No Let's Encrypt** for `.onion` (ACME requires public DNS)."
msgstr "**Ei Krüpteerime** jaoks `.onion` (ACME nõuab avalikku DNSi)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**No Let’s Encrypt** for ``.onion`` (ACME requires public DNS)."
msgstr "**Ei, krüpteerime** jaoks ``.onion`` (ACME nõuab avalikku DNSi)."

# libretranslate
msgid "**No Outbound Surprises:** The upstream app catalog fetch to github.com is disabled. Without ``web-svc-coturn`` the app still falls back to its built-in Google STUN server, since suppressing the variable entirely would leave WebRTC with none at all."
msgstr "**Väljaminevad üllatused puuduvad:** ülesvoolu rakenduste kataloogi tõmbamine github.com on puudega. Ilma ``web-svc-coturn`` rakendus langeb ikka tagasi oma sisseehitatud Google STUN-serverisse, kuna muutuja täielik allasurumine jätaks WebRTC-le üldse mitte."

# libretranslate
msgid "**No Outbound Surprises:** The upstream app catalog fetch to github.com is disabled. Without `web-svc-coturn` the app still falls back to its built-in Google STUN server, since suppressing the variable entirely would leave WebRTC with none at all."
msgstr "**Väljaminevad üllatused puuduvad:** ülesvoolu rakenduste kataloogi tõmbamine github.com on puudega. Ilma `web-svc-coturn` rakendus langeb ikka tagasi oma sisseehitatud Google STUN-serverisse, kuna muutuja täielik allasurumine jätaks WebRTC-le üldse mitte."

# libretranslate
msgid "**No allowlist edits** are needed when introducing new make targets, scripts, tooling, or shell shapes (redirects, pipes, env-prefixes, quoted args)."
