# libretranslate
msgid "**OIDC JVM CA trust (self-signed TLS only):** when `TLS_MODE == self_signed`, the backend command (in `templates/compose.yml.j2`) imports the internal CA into a writable `cacerts` copy and points the JVM at it via `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS`. The shared `with-ca-trust.sh` entrypoint covers the OS/NSS/env trust stores but not the JVM truststore, so without this Penpot's server-side OIDC token/userinfo calls to Keycloak fail with `PKIX path building failed`. The override is gated behind self-signed mode (it is a no-op in production, where real CA-signed certs are already trusted) and the CA path is hardcoded because the framework's CA-override re-serialises the command."
msgstr "**OIDC JVM CA trust (ainult ise allkirjastatud TLS):** millal `TLS_MODE == self_signed`, taustaprogrammi käsk (sisse `templates/compose.yml.j2`) Sisemise CA importimine kirjutatavasse `cacerts` kopeerida ja suunata JVM selle kaudu `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS`. Jagatud `with-ca-trust.sh` sisenemispunkt hõlmab OS/NSS/env usalduspoode, kuid mitte JVM-i usalduskauplust, nii et ilma selle Penpot'i serveripoolse OIDC-märgi / kasutajainfo kõnedeta ei õnnestu Keycloakil `PKIX path building failed`. Tühistamine toimub iseallkirjastamise režiimi taga (see on tootmises keelatud, kui tegelikke CA-allkirjastatud sertifikaate juba usaldatakse) ja CA rada on kõvakodeeritud, sest raamistiku CA-override muudab käsu."

# libretranslate
msgid "**OIDC JVM CA trust (self-signed TLS only):** when ``TLS_MODE == self_signed``, the backend command (in ``templates/compose.yml.j2``) imports the internal CA into a writable ``cacerts`` copy and points the JVM at it via ``JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS``. The shared ``with-ca-trust.sh`` entrypoint covers the OS/NSS/env trust stores but not the JVM truststore, so without this Penpot’s server-side OIDC token/userinfo calls to Keycloak fail with ``PKIX path building failed``. The override is gated behind self-signed mode (it is a no-op in production, where real CA-signed certs are already trusted) and the CA path is hardcoded because the framework’s CA-override re-serialises the command."
msgstr "**OIDC JVM CA trust (ainult ise allkirjastatud TLS):** millal ``TLS_MODE == self_signed``, taustaprogrammi käsk (sisse ``templates/compose.yml.j2``) Sisemise CA importimine kirjutatavasse ``cacerts`` kopeerida ja suunata JVM selle kaudu ``JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS``. Jagatud ``with-ca-trust.sh`` sisenemispunkt hõlmab OS/NSS/env usalduspoode, kuid mitte JVM-i usalduskauplust, nii et ilma selle Penpot'i serveripoolse OIDC-märgi / kasutajainfo kõnedeta ei õnnestu Keycloakil ``PKIX path building failed``. Tühistamine toimub iseallkirjastamise režiimi taga (see on tootmises keelatud, kui tegelikke CA-allkirjastatud sertifikaate juba usaldatakse) ja CA tee on kõvakodeeritud, sest raamistiku CA-override muudab käsu."

