msgstr "**Tööaja pinning:** Komponeerimisrežiimis Hermes Agent ja OpenClaw pin `SANDBOX_RUNTIME` otse teenistuses."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Runtime pinning:** In compose mode Hermes Agent and OpenClaw pin ``SANDBOX_RUNTIME`` on their service directly."
msgstr "**Tööaja pinning:** Komponeerimisrežiimis Hermes Agent ja OpenClaw pin ``SANDBOX_RUNTIME`` otse teenistuses."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Runtime probing:** The container role checks every host for `/dev/kvm`, for the Kata shim binary and for docker-in-docker, and publishes the resulting choice between `kata` and `runsc` as `SANDBOX_RUNTIME`."
msgstr "**Käivituskatse:** Konteineri roll kontrollib iga masina `/dev/kvm`, Kata shim binaarne ja docker-in-docker, ning avaldab sellest tuleneva valiku `kata` ja `runsc` nagu `SANDBOX_RUNTIME`."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Runtime probing:** The container role checks every host for ``/dev/kvm``, for the Kata shim binary and for docker-in-docker, and publishes the resulting choice between ``kata`` and ``runsc`` as ``SANDBOX_RUNTIME``."
msgstr "**Käivituskatse:** Konteineri roll kontrollib iga masina ``/dev/kvm``, Kata shim binaarne ja docker-in-docker, ning avaldab sellest tuleneva valiku ``kata`` ja ``runsc`` nagu ``SANDBOX_RUNTIME``."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Runtime target:** Cloudflare Workers (`wrangler.jsonc` present), backed by **D1** (Cloudflare's SQLite) as the aggregator cache and **Meilisearch** (optional) for full-text + geo search."
msgstr "**Tööaja sihtmärk:** Cloudflare'i töötajad (`wrangler.jsonc` kohalolev), mida toetab **D1** (Cloudflare'i SQLite) agregaatorvahemäluna ja **Meilisearch** (vabatahtlik) täisteksti + geootsingu jaoks."

# libretranslate
msgid "**S3-compatible API:** Standard S3 SDKs and CLIs work against the gateway for uploads, media, attachments, and exports."
msgstr "**S3-ühilduv API:** Standard S3 SDK-d ja CLI-d töötavad üleslaadimiste, meedia, manuste ja ekspordi värava vastu."

# libretranslate
msgid "**S3-compatible object storage (future):** Penpot supports an ``assets-s3`` backend (``PENPOT_STORAGE_ASSETS_FS_*`` → ``PENPOT_STORAGE_ASSETS_S3_*``). It is intentionally **not** implemented here; switching the backend and adding the S3 credentials to ``meta/secrets.yml`` is the documented upgrade path."
msgstr "**S3-ühilduv objektide salvestamine (tuleviku):** Penpot toetab ``assets-s3`` taustaprogrammi (``PENPOT_STORAGE_ASSETS_FS_*`` → ``PENPOT_STORAGE_ASSETS_S3_*``)See on tahtlikult **ei** rakendatakse siin; taustaprogrammi vahetamine ja S lisamine3 volikirja ``meta/secrets.yml`` on dokumenteeritud uuendamistee."

# libretranslate
msgid "**S3-compatible object storage (future):** Penpot supports an `assets-s3` backend (`PENPOT_STORAGE_ASSETS_FS_*` → `PENPOT_STORAGE_ASSETS_S3_*`). It is intentionally **not** implemented here; switching the backend and adding the S3 credentials to `meta/secrets.yml` is the documented upgrade path."
msgstr "**S3-ühilduv objektide salvestamine (tuleviku):** Penpot toetab `assets-s3` taustaprogrammi (`PENPOT_STORAGE_ASSETS_FS_*` → `PENPOT_STORAGE_ASSETS_S3_*`)See on tahtlikult **ei** rakendatakse siin; taustaprogrammi vahetamine ja S lisamine3 volikirja `meta/secrets.yml` on dokumenteeritud uuendamistee."

