msgstr "**Isejuhtiv:** Käivitage CI tööd oma serveris ilma GitHubi hostitud jooksjaminutiteta."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Self-registration** is *on* when OIDC is enabled and *off* otherwise — also derived from the ``sso`` service flag. Penpot routes first-time OIDC logins through the registration path (a disabled flag makes the callback fail with ``?error=registration-disabled`` for not-yet-provisioned users), so registration must stay on wherever OIDC is. Native admin is bootstrapped and LDAP self-provisions without it. ``PENPOT_FLAGS`` renders ``enable-registration`` / ``disable-registration`` accordingly."
msgstr "**Eneseregistreerimine** on *peal* kui OIDC on lubatud ja *maha* muul viisil – tuletatud ka ``sso`` teenistuslipp. Penpot viib OIDC esmakordse sisselogimise läbi registreerimistee (Keelatud lipp muudab tagasikutsumise ebaõnnestumiseks ``?error=registration-disabled`` seni teenindamata kasutajatele), nii et registreerimine peab jääma sinna, kus OIDC asub. Native admin on bootstrapped ja LDAP isesätted ilma selleta. ``PENPOT_FLAGS`` renderdab ``enable-registration`` / ``disable-registration`` vastavalt."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Self-registration** is *on* when OIDC is enabled and *off* otherwise — also derived from the `sso` service flag. Penpot routes first-time OIDC logins through the registration path (a disabled flag makes the callback fail with `?error=registration-disabled` for not-yet-provisioned users), so registration must stay on wherever OIDC is. Native admin is bootstrapped and LDAP self-provisions without it. `PENPOT_FLAGS` renders `enable-registration` / `disable-registration` accordingly."
msgstr "**Eneseregistreerimine** on *peal* kui OIDC on lubatud ja *maha* muul viisil – tuletatud ka `sso` teenistuslipp. Penpot viib OIDC esmakordse sisselogimise läbi registreerimistee (Keelatud lipp muudab tagasikutsumise ebaõnnestumiseks `?error=registration-disabled` seni teenindamata kasutajatele), nii et registreerimine peab jääma sinna, kus OIDC asub. Native admin on bootstrapped ja LDAP isesätted ilma selleta. `PENPOT_FLAGS` renderdab `enable-registration` / `disable-registration` vastavalt."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Sentinel `__ALL__` in the `whitelist` input** (case-insensitive). The diff logic MUST be skipped and an empty whitelist MUST be emitted, which deploys everything in the workflow's scope. This is the explicit opt-out from diff narrowing for manual dispatch."
msgstr "**Sentinel `__ALL__` sisse `whitelist` sisend** (juhtumitundlik). Diff-loogika PEAB vahele jätma ja tühje valgenimekiri PEAB eralduma, mis rakendab töövoo ulatuses kõike. See on selge loobumine diff kitsendamisest käsitsi saatmisel."

