msgstr "Ole idempotentne (sama puhastuse uuesti käivitamine EI TOHI viga: juba kadunud ressursi teine kustutamine PEAB olema opivaba)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Because Bash is allowed wholesale, the operational safety of shell invocations rests on three layers, in order of precedence:"
