# libretranslate
msgid "Both authenticated Playwright personas are blocked while ``services.sso.enabled`` is false. The dashboard’s entire Keycloak integration is the browser-side ``oidc.js`` bundle, and ``DASHBOARD_JS_FILES`` in ``vars/main.yml`` ships that file only when SSO is enabled, so with SSO off the page renders neither a Login link nor a logout control."
msgstr "Mõlemad autentsed Playwrighti isikud on blokeeritud ``services.sso.enabled`` on vale. Armatuurlaua kogu Keycloaki integreerimine on brauseri pool ``oidc.js`` kimp ja ``DASHBOARD_JS_FILES`` sisse ``vars/main.yml`` laevad, mis failivad ainult siis, kui SSO on lubatud, nii et SSO ei muuda sisselogimislinki ega väljalogimise juhtimist."

