# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Cached YAML load that returns `{}` for missing files (legacy contract). Non-mapping roots surface as `SystemExit` to match the inventory CLI's existing error UX."
msgstr "Salvestatud YAML- i koormus, mis tagastab `{}` puuduvate failide jaoks (annakuleping). Mittekaardistatavad juurepinnad `SystemExit` et sobitada inventari CLI olemasolevat viga UX."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cached keyed on (applications fingerprint, include_aliases); the result is returned as-is, so callers MUST treat it as read-only."
msgstr "Puhverdatud võti (taotluste sõrmejäljed, include_aliases); Tulemus tagastatakse nii, nagu on, nii et helistajad peavad seda käsitlema kirjutuskaitstuna."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cached keyed on (roles_dir, variables_signature, render_state). A read issued while the applications render is in progress sees the unrendered tree, whose service flags are still Jinja strings; its map is cached under its own key so the render's own call sites reuse it without it ever being served as the finished map. The tor flags are rendered before they are read (``_resolved_flag``), so that mid-render map carries the same onion domains the finished one does."
msgstr "Puhverdatud võti (roles_dir, variables_signature, render_state). Rakenduste renderdamise ajal välja antud lugem näeb renderdamata puud, mille teeninduslipud on endiselt Jinja stringid; selle kaart on vahemälus oma võtme all, nii et renderi enda kõnesaitid kasutavad seda uuesti, ilma et seda kunagi serveeritaks valmis kaardina. Torni lipud renderdatakse enne nende lugemist (``_resolved_flag``), nii et keskrenderkaart kannab samu sibula domeene, mida valmis."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cached value: the **list of documents** ``yaml.safe_load_all`` returns for that file. Single-document YAML files cache as a 1-element list, so a callsite that asks for the single doc (``load_yaml`` / ``load_yaml_any``) and a callsite that asks for the multi-doc list (``load_yaml_all``) share **the same parse**. The same list / dict instances are returned to every caller, so callers that mutate the result MUST `copy.deepcopy()` it first. Treat the value as read-only."
msgstr "Vahetatud väärtus: **dokumentide loetelu** ``yaml.safe_load_all`` tagastab selle faili. Ühe dokumendi YAML- failide vahemälu 1- elemendiloend, seega kõnesait, mis küsib ühe dokumendi (``load_yaml`` / ``load_yaml_any``) ja kõnesait, mis küsib multidoc loendit (``load_yaml_all``) jagada **sama pars**Igale helistajale tagastatakse sama nimekiri / dict-eksemplarid, seega peavad tulemuse muteeruvad helistajad `copy.deepcopy()` esimesena. Väärtust käsitletakse kirjutuskaitstuna."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cached: repeated calls for the same *role_dir* reuse the first parse. Pass an absolute path so the cache key is stable across callers that resolve relative paths differently."
msgstr "Vahemälu: korduvad üleskutsed samaks *role_dir* taaskasutada esimest parssi. Läbige absoluutne tee, nii et vahemälu klahv on stabiilne kõigis helistajates, kes lahendavad suhtelisi teid erinevalt."

