msgid "Clients present a Gitea personal access token as ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. The token is issued against the administrator account and kept in ``sys-token-store``. Its ``auth_subject`` is ``administrator``, so MCP calls run with administrator rights rather than as the requesting user."
msgstr "Kliendid esitavad Gitea isikliku juurdepääsu märgi ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. Läbipääsuluba väljastatakse administraatori konto vastu ja seda hoitakse ``sys-token-store``. ``auth_subject`` on ``administrator``, nii et MCP kõned töötavad administraatori õigustega, mitte taotleva kasutajana."

# libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a long-lived access token as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. The token is minted once per deployment and kept in `sys-token-store` under the `administrator` user, not in the role's `credentials:` block. An unauthenticated request is answered with 404: Home Assistant does not reveal the endpoint."
msgstr "Kliendid esitavad pikaealise juurdepääsuloa kui `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. Märk vermitakse üks kord iga kasutuselevõtu kohta ja hoitakse `sys-token-store` alt `administrator` kasutaja, mitte rollis `credentials:` blokk. Kinnitamata taotlusele vastatakse 404: Home Assistant ei näita lõpp-punkti."

# libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a long-lived access token as ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. The token is minted once per deployment and kept in ``sys-token-store`` under the ``administrator`` user, not in the role’s ``credentials:`` block. An unauthenticated request is answered with 404: Home Assistant does not reveal the endpoint."
msgstr "Kliendid esitavad pikaealise juurdepääsuloa kui ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. Märk vermitakse üks kord iga kasutuselevõtu kohta ja hoitakse ``sys-token-store`` alt ``administrator`` kasutaja, mitte rollis ``credentials:`` blokk. Kinnitamata taotlusele vastatakse 404: Home Assistant ei näita lõpp-punkti."

