# libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a `requirements/requirements.galaxy.yml` collection from the requirement to also carry a `type: git` entry in `requirements/requirements.git.yml`. Reserved for collections that publish no usable git remote; without the git entry a `galaxy.ansible.com` outage fails `make install`, because the fallback in `scripts/install/ansible.sh` cannot resolve the collection either."
msgstr "Vabastab `requirements/requirements.galaxy.yml` kogumine nõudest kanda kaasas ka `type: git` sissekanne `requirements/requirements.git.yml`. Reserveeritud kogudele, mis ei avalda kasutatavat git remote; ilma git kirjeta a `galaxy.ansible.com` katkestused `make install`, sest tagasilöök `scripts/install/ansible.sh` Samuti ei saa kogumist lahendada."

# libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a `roles/*/meta/services.yml` healthcheck flavor from the requirement that the role's `files/Dockerfile` install the binary the probe runs, when the service sits on a `-slim` image. MUST name where the binary comes from instead. A `-slim` tag carries the runtime and nothing around it, so `curl` is absent and the probe fails from the first beat; under swarm the task is then reaped with exit 137 and every deployment holding the service in its closure fails on the convergence wait, naming the service rather than the missing binary."
msgstr "Vabastab `roles/*/meta/services.yml` Tervisekontrolli maitse nõudest, et roll on `files/Dockerfile` paigaldab kahendsüsteemi, mida sondi käivitatakse, kui teenus istub `-slim` pilt. Selle asemel peab olema nimi, kust binaarne tuleb. A `-slim` Silt kannab jooksvat aega ja mitte midagi selle ümber, nii et `curl` puudub ja sond ebaõnnestub esimesest löögist; sülemi all lõigatakse ülesanne väljumisega 137 ja iga lähetus, mis hoiab teenust selle sulgemisel, ei oota konvergentsi, nimetades teenuse asemel puuduva binaarse."

# libretranslate
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "Exempts a `roles/*/templates/*compose.yml.j2` line, or the whole file (head marker), from the canonical compose skeleton: base-include header, `{{ service_name }}:` service keys each preceded by their `{% set service_name %}`, all per-service `{% set %}` knobs on two-space-indented dash-free lines above the key, `{% include %}` at four spaces inside the service body, and column-0 `compose_volumes` / `compose_networks` at the tail. The layout renders correctly because the `stack_host_template` action plugin sets `lstrip_blocks=True` for `compose.yml.j2`. Reserved for legitimate deviations that genuinely cannot follow the skeleton."
msgstr "Vabastab `roles/*/templates/*compose.yml.j2` rida või kogu fail (peamarker), kanoonilisest komponeeritud skeletist: baaslisa päis, `{{ service_name }}:` teenusevõtmed, millest igaühele eelneb `{% set service_name %}`, kõik teenuse kohta `{% set %}` nupud kahe kosmosega tihendatud kriipsuvabadel joontel võtme kohal, `{% include %}` neljas ruumis teeninduskere sees ja kolonn...0 `compose_volumes` / `compose_networks` sabas. Paigutus on õige, sest `stack_host_template` toimingupluginad `lstrip_blocks=True` jaoks `compose.yml.j2`... reserveeritud seaduslikele kõrvalekalletele, mis ei suuda skeletti jälgida."

# libretranslate
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "Exempts a `when` / `failed_when` / `changed_when` / `until` value that legitimately carries `{{ }}` / `{% %}`. Reserved for genuine edge cases; the default path is a bare expression. Per-item render/apply data guards belong on a `condition:` data field (honored by the sys-svc-compose render helper and `LISTMONK_SETTINGS`), not `when:`."
msgstr "Vabastab `when` / `failed_when` / `changed_when` / `until` väärtus, mis seaduslikult kannab `{{ }}` / `{% %}`. Reserveeritud ehtsate servade puhul; vaikimisi asukoht on paljasavaldis. Üksiku renderdamise/rakenduse andmekaitsjad kuuluvad `condition:` andmeväli (austatud sys-svc-compose renderdaja `LISTMONK_SETTINGS`), mitte `when:`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a database-backed `web-app-*` role from the requirement to declare a seaweedfs object-store service. Place in the head of `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Use only when the application genuinely needs no object storage."
msgstr "Väljub andmebaasi tagatud `web-app-*` roll merevetikate objekt-ladu teenuse deklareerimise nõudest. Koht peas `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Kasutada ainult siis, kui rakendus tõesti ei vaja objekti ladustamist."

# libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a deprecated `add_header` / `Header set/add` line for `X-Frame-Options` / `X-XSS-Protection` / `X-Download-Options` / `X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies`. Prefer Content-Security-Policy via the role's `meta/server.yml` (`csp.flags` / `csp.whitelist`)."
msgstr "Vabastab aegunud `add_header` / `Header set/add` liin `X-Frame-Options` / `X-XSS-Protection` / `X-Download-Options` / `X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies`. Eelista sisu-turvalisuspoliitikat rolli kaudu `meta/server.yml` (`csp.flags` / `csp.whitelist`)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a domain-serving role (`web-`/`svc-db-` prefix or explicit `domains.canonical`) from the \"must declare a `tor:` block in `meta/services.yml`\" contract. Reserved for roles with no onion surface, e.g. pure redirect helpers."
msgstr "Keelab domeeniserveri rolli (`web-`/`svc-db-` eesliide või selgesõnaline `domains.canonical`) alates \"deklareerima `tor:` blokk `meta/services.yml`\" leping. Reserveeritud rollidele, millel ei ole sibulapinda, nt puhtad ümbersuunamisabilised."

# libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a server-capable `roles/<role>/meta/mcp.yml` from the \"must carry a `\"{{ '<client>' in group_names }}\"`-gated `services.<client-entity>` entry for every role declaring `mcp_consumer: true`\" check. Reserved for a provider that legitimately owns no co-deploy edge to its clients."
msgstr "Vabastab serveri võimekuse `roles/<role>/meta/mcp.yml` alates \"peab kandma `\"{{ '<client>' in group_names }}\"`-Varastas `services.<client-entity>` iga rolli deklareerimine `mcp_consumer: true`\" kontrollida. Reserveeritud teenusepakkujale, kellel ei ole seaduslikult oma klientidele ühiskasutuse eelist."

# libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a server-capable `roles/<role>/meta/mcp.yml` from the \"must ship one `meta/variants.yml` entry enabling every admitted consumer, with `sso` pinned on, and pulling in a consumer variant that does not pin `sso: false`\" check. Reserved for a provider whose pairing is genuinely proven elsewhere."
msgstr "Vabastab serveri võimekuse `roles/<role>/meta/mcp.yml` alates \"vean `meta/variants.yml` turulepääs, mis võimaldab igal vastuvõetud tarbijal `sso` nööritud ja tõmmatakse sisse tarbijavariant, mis ei `sso: false`\" kontrollida. Reserveeritud teenusepakkujale, kelle paaristumine on mujal tõeliselt tõestatud."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Exempts a top-level key in `roles/<role>/{vars,defaults}/main.yml` or `group_vars/**/*.yml` from the \"must be referenced\" check. Use when the consumer is non-YAML/Jinja (Python plugins, external tools)."
msgstr "Tühistab tipptaseme võtme `roles/<role>/{vars,defaults}/main.yml` või `group_vars/**/*.yml` alates \"tuleb viidata\" kontrollida. Kasutamine, kui tarbija ei ole YAML/Jinja (Pythoni pluginad, välised tööriistad)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Exempts a top-level service in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml` from the \"must be registered as `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`\" check."
msgstr "Lõpetab tipptaseme teenuse `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml` alates \"tuleb registreerida `<NAME>_SERVICE_ENABLED=` sisse `templates/playwright.env.j2`\" kontrollida."

# libretranslate
msgid "Exempts an auth-isolated variant entry in `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` (one that enables exactly one of LDAP / OIDC / OAuth2) from the rule that every non-auth service-key in the role's variant union must be pinned to literal `false`. Place on the leading `- services:` line of the variant or on the line above. Use only when the broader closure is intentional."
msgstr "Tühistab autentimist isoleeriva variandi kirje `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` (Üks, mis võimaldab täpselt ühe LDAP / OIDC / OAuth2) reeglist, et iga rolli variantide liidu mitteauth-võti tuleb kinnitada sõna-sõnalt `false`. Asetage juhtpositsioonile `- services:` variandi rida või eespool olev rida. Kasuta ainult siis, kui laiem sulgemine on tahtlik."

# libretranslate
msgid "Exempts one `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` `services.<key>.shared: false` pin from the one-local-provider-variant limit for a service whose base `meta/services.yml` uses literal `enabled: true` and dynamic `shared`. Place on the extra `shared: false` line or service key line. Place above the service key in `meta/services.yml` to exempt the service."
msgstr "Vabastab ühe `roles/*/meta/variants.yml` `services.<key>.shared: false` ühekohalise teenuseosutaja-variandi limiit teenuse puhul, mille baasväärtus on `meta/services.yml` kasutab sõnasõnalist `enabled: true` dünaamilise `shared`. . Asetage ekstra `shared: false` liini või teenuse võtmerida. Asend teenusevõtme kohal `meta/services.yml` vabastada teenus maksust."

# libretranslate
msgid "Exhaustive Application-ID Audit"
msgstr "Taotluse ID täielik audit"

# libretranslate
msgid "Existing inventory values are preserved (no double-encryption, no overwrite of operator-supplied secrets)."
msgstr "Olemasolevad varude väärtused säilitatakse (ei ole topeltkrüptimist, ei kirjuta üle operaatori poolt tarnitud saladusi)."

