msgid "If container or security setup behaves differently than on Linux, the WSL2 guide covers the usual [Docker Buildx](https://docs.docker.com/reference/cli/docker/buildx/), [DNS](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Domain_Name_System), and [AppArmor](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AppArmor)-related workarounds."
msgstr "Kui konteiner või turvaseadistus käitub teisiti kui Linuxis, siis WSL2 juhend katab tavapärase [Docker Buildx](https://docs.docker.com/reference/cli/docker/buildx/), [DNS](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Domain_Name_System), ja [AppArmor](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/AppArmor)- sellega seotud ümberehitused."

# libretranslate
msgid "If disk space is tight, you SHOULD move Docker data, caches, and your working directory to the SSD."
msgstr "Kui kettaruum on tihe, peaksite Dockeri andmed, vahemälud ja töökataloogi SSD-sse liigutama."

