# libretranslate
msgid "In all communication and when handling data, you MUST respect the [Hacker Ethics](https://www.ccc.de/de/hackerethik) as defined by the Chaos Computer Club. This means treating information responsibly, protecting privacy, and acting in the interest of the public good."
msgstr "Kogu suhtluses ja andmete töötlemisel peate austama [Häkkerieetika](https://www.ccc.de/de/hackerethik) Nagu defineerib Chaos Computer Club. See tähendab teabe vastutustundlikku käsitlemist, privaatsuse kaitsmist ja avalike hüvede huvides tegutsemist."

# libretranslate
msgid "In compose mode the lookup returns the empty string because docker-compose ignores `deploy.replicas`. Wrapping the emit in the `deploy:` block remains the caller's responsibility - typically `roles/sys-svc-container/templates/deploy.yml.j2`."
msgstr "Komponeerimisrežiimis tagastab otsing tühja stringi, sest docker- compose ignoreerib `deploy.replicas`. Emissiooni kirjutamine `deploy:` plokk jääb helistaja vastutuseks - tavaliselt `roles/sys-svc-container/templates/deploy.yml.j2`."

# libretranslate
msgid "In embedded mode (``shared: false``) a consumer’s compose stack receives a storage-only SeaweedFS container without UI or published ports. The embedded S3 listener performs no authentication, so it MUST stay confined to the consumer’s isolated compose network."
msgstr "Põimitud režiimis (``shared: false``) tarbija komponeeritud virna saab ainult hoiustamiseks mõeldud SeaweedFS konteineri ilma kasutajaliideseta või avaldatud sadamateta. Manustatud S3 kuulaja ei teosta autentimist, seega PEAB see piirduma tarbija isoleeritud komponeerimisvõrguga."

# libretranslate
msgid "In embedded mode (`shared: false`) a consumer's compose stack receives a storage-only SeaweedFS container without UI or published ports. The embedded S3 listener performs no authentication, so it MUST stay confined to the consumer's isolated compose network."
