# libretranslate
msgid "In swarm mode the `restart:` top-level service key is silently ignored because swarm replaces it with `deploy.restart_policy` (rendered by `roles/sys-svc-container/templates/deploy.yml.j2`). Emitting `restart:` under swarm produces an \"Ignoring unsupported options\" warning at `docker stack deploy` time and double-declares the intent."
msgstr "Parverežiimis `restart:` tipptaseme teenindusvõtit ignoreeritakse vaikselt, sest parv asendab selle `deploy.restart_policy` (hukatud `roles/sys-svc-container/templates/deploy.yml.j2`). `restart:` sülemi all tekib \"Toetamata valikute ignoreerimine\" hoiatus `docker stack deploy` Aeg ja kaks korda deklareerivad kavatsust."

# libretranslate
msgid "In the SSO-enabled variant the Keycloak round trip satisfies the oauth2-proxy but leaves LAM itself signed out, so the persona lands back on LAM's own login form and finds no logout control there."
msgstr "SSO-toega variandis rahuldab Keycloaki edasi-tagasi reis2- Proxy, kuid jätab LAM-i endast välja, nii et isik maandub LAM-i enda sisselogimisvormile ja ei leia sealt väljalogimiskontrolli."

