# libretranslate
msgid "LDAP is not feasible: LibreTranslate authenticates programmatic clients with API keys, and LDAP cannot map onto that model. RBAC is also not feasible because authorisation in LibreTranslate is API-key-tier only and decoupled from any IDP. The OIDC gate protects the UI but does not grant differential authorisation inside the app. These LDAP and RBAC exceptions are documented per [lifecycle.md](../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/lifecycle.md)."
msgstr "LDAP ei ole teostatav: LibreTranslate autentib programmilisi kliente API võtmetega ja LDAP ei saa seda mudelit kaardistada. RBAC ei ole ka teostatav, sest LibreTranslate'i autoriseerimine on ainult API-võtmetasandi ja lahti seotud mis tahes IDP-st. OIDC-värav kaitseb kasutajaliidest, kuid ei anna rakenduse sees diferentsiaalluba. Need LDAP ja RBAC erandid on dokumenteeritud iga [lifecycle.md](../../docs/contributing/design/role/services/lifecycle.md)."

