# libretranslate
msgid "MDAD's `ansible-playbook setup.yml` invocation is encapsulated in a dedicated sub-container (DinD #2 relative to the Infinito deploy container which is DinD #1). The runner image is built locally from `roles/web-app-matrix/files/flavor/ansible/runner/Dockerfile` and pinned via `services.matrix.runner.image`. The runner bind-mounts `/var/run/docker.sock`, `/etc/systemd/system`, `/run/systemd`, `/usr/local/bin`, `/matrix`, and the MDAD checkout so MDAD's writes land in the deploy container's namespace (same Docker daemon and systemd as the rest of the stack)."
msgstr "MDAD `ansible-playbook setup.yml` akumulatsioon kapseldatakse spetsiaalsesse alamkonteinerisse (DinD2 Infinito kasutuselevõtu konteiner, mis on DinD #1). Jooksja pilt on ehitatud kohalikult `roles/web-app-matrix/files/flavor/ansible/runner/Dockerfile` ja kinnitatud `services.matrix.runner.image`. Jooksja seob kinnitused `/var/run/docker.sock`, `/etc/systemd/system`, `/run/systemd`, `/usr/local/bin`, `/matrix`, ja MDAD kassasse, nii et MDAD kirjutab maa kasutuselevõtu konteineri nimeruumis (Sama Dockeri deemon ja süsteemne nagu ülejäänud virna)."

