msgid "Run `make compose-playwright role=<role> keep=true`. You MAY pass `pw=\"--grep <pattern>\"` (or any other `npx playwright test` argument). Set `keep=true` on every inner-loop run regardless of the previous result; omit only when the user has explicitly opted out. For the full propagation chain see [Playwright Tests](../../../contributing/actions/testing/playwright.md#artefact-retention-)."
msgstr "Jookse `make compose-playwright role=<role> keep=true`. Sa võid mööduda. `pw=\"--grep <pattern>\"` (või muud `npx playwright test` argument). Valmis. `keep=true` igal sisemisel ahelal olenemata eelmisest tulemusest; välja jätta ainult siis, kui kasutaja on selgesõnaliselt loobunud. Kogu leviahela kohta vaata artiklit [Playwrighti testid](../../../contributing/actions/testing/playwright.md#artefact-retention-)."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run `make dotenv`."
msgstr "Jookse `make dotenv`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run `make install-alias` to install the aliases into your shell config; afterwards open a new shell or `source ~/.bashrc`."
msgstr "Jookse `make install-alias` pseudonüümide paigaldamiseks shelli seadistusse; seejärel ava uus shell või `source ~/.bashrc`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run `make test-integration` (or `make test-lint` for lint tests) and verify all tests pass."
msgstr "Jookse `make test-integration` (või `make test-lint` loomkatseks) ja kontrollima kõikide katsete läbimist."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run `make test-unit` and verify all tests pass."
msgstr "Jookse `make test-unit` ja kontrollima kõikide katsete läbimist."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run `make test` locally and confirm everything is green."
msgstr "Jookse `make test` Kinnitage, et kõik on roheline."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run `make test` — all linting and unit tests must pass before deploy."
msgstr "Jookse `make test` — kõik tulbi- ja üksikkatsed peavad enne kasutuselevõttu läbima."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run `python -m cli.contributing.network.diagnose` to print a structured DNS / TCP / TLS / PMTU report (IPv4 + IPv6) plus interface MTU, `/etc/resolv.conf`, `/etc/hosts`, proxy env vars, and CA bundle summaries from inside the running infinito container. Exposed as `make diagnose-network`."
msgstr "Jookse `python -m cli.contributing.network.diagnose` printida struktureeritud DNS / TCP / TLS / PMTU aruanne (IPv4 IPv6) pluss liides MTU, `/etc/resolv.conf`, `/etc/hosts`, proxy env vars ja CA kimpude kokkuvõtted jooksva infinito konteineri seest. paljastatud `make diagnose-network`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run `python -m cli.contributing.update.source --dry-run` to list pending bumps; the `update-version-sources` job of `.github/workflows/cron-update.yml` opens the PRs, and `tests/external/update/source/` warns about them."
msgstr "Jookse `python -m cli.contributing.update.source --dry-run` ootel olevate muhkude loetlemiseks; `update-version-sources` tööd `.github/workflows/cron-update.yml` avab PR-d ja `tests/external/update/source/` hoiatab nende eest."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run `python -m cli.meta.ci.slots --matrix` to see the whole budget."
msgstr "Jookse `python -m cli.meta.ci.slots --matrix` näha kogu eelarvet."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run a command with stdout/stderr passthrough."
msgstr "Käsu käivitamine stdout/stderr läbisõiduga."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run a subprocess and stream stdout/stderr live to the terminal."
msgstr "Käivita alamprotsess ja voog otse terminali."

