# libretranslate
msgid "Single source for the args shared by the standalone provider stack (``compose.yml.j2``) and the local sidecar (``service.yml.j2``). ``-ip=localhost`` is deliberate: the all-in-one server otherwise advertises the auto-detected swarm ingress IP, which is unreachable for gRPC and hangs ``weed shell`` during bucket provisioning."
msgstr "Üks allikas kangide jaoks, mida jagavad eraldiseisvad pakkujad (``compose.yml.j2``) ja kohalik külgkorv (``service.yml.j2``). ``-ip=localhost`` on tahtlik: all-in-one server reklaamib muul viisil automaatselt tuvastatavat parve ingress IP-d, mis on gRPC ja ripsmete jaoks kättesaamatu ``weed shell`` kopperaldiste ajal."

# libretranslate
msgid "Single source for the two consumers that must agree: ``extend_inventory`` turns the placements into inventory groups, and ``matrix`` turns the same placements into ``remote-2-local.backup_providers``. Exception: the group membership is also what runs ``user-backup`` on that node, so a node named as a provider without its group has no authorized pull key, and ``roles/svc-bkp-remote-2-local/templates/script.sh.j2`` counts one error per failing provider and exits 1 for the whole unit."
msgstr "Üks allikas kahele tarbijale, kes peavad kokku leppima: ``extend_inventory`` koondab paigutused inventuurirühmadesse ja ``matrix`` muudab samad paigutused ``remote-2-local.backup_providers``. Erand: grupiliikmelisus on ka see, mis jookseb ``user-backup`` sellel sõlmel, nii et sõlmel, mida nimetatakse pakkujaks ilma selle rühmata, ei ole volitatud tõmbevõtit ja ``roles/svc-bkp-remote-2-local/templates/script.sh.j2`` loeb ühe vea iga ebaõnnestunud pakkuja ja väljumise kohta 1 tervele üksusele."

# libretranslate
