# libretranslate
msgid "Some CI failures (most notably OOM-kills such as [#162](https://github.com/infinito-nexus/core/issues/162), PeerTube plugin install with `rc=137`) only surface under the memory and CPU ceiling of the GitHub-hosted runner and cannot be reproduced on a workstation with plenty of RAM. To reproduce these failures locally, you MUST cap the resources of the top-level `infinito` service in [compose.yml](../../../../compose.yml) to values that match (or undercut) the runner specs below."
msgstr "Mõned CI vead (eelkõige OOM-i tapmised, näiteks [#162](https://github.com/infinito-nexus/core/issues/162), PeerTube plugina installimine `rc=137`) ainult pind GitHubi hostitud jooksja mälu ja protsessori lae all ning seda ei saa paljundada tööjaamas, kus on palju muutmälu. Nende tõrgete kohalikuks reprodutseerimiseks peate piirama tipptasemel ressursse `infinito` teenistuses [compose.yml](../../../../compose.yml) väärtustele (õõnestada) jooksja andmed allpool."

