msgstr "Swarm"

# libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - `<stack>_<service_key>`, matching how Docker Swarm names every service and how `container service ps` accepts them. The stack name is derived from ``application_id`` via the ``get_entity_name`` filter, mirroring how ``docker stack deploy`` composes the stack name in ``sys-svc-compose/handlers/main.yml``."
msgstr "Swarm režiim - `<stack>_<service_key>`, sobitades Docker Swarm iga teenuse nimi ja kuidas `container service ps` aktsepteerib neid. Stacki nimi on tuletatud ``application_id`` läbi ``get_entity_name`` filter, peegeldamine, kuidas ``docker stack deploy`` komponeerib pinu nime ``sys-svc-compose/handlers/main.yml``."

# libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - a shell subshell that resolves the running task's container ID at exec time, e.g. `\"$(/usr/bin/resolve-container-id mattermost mattermost)\"`. Swarm names every service ``<stack>_<key>`` and accepts no prefix matching; the helper composes that name from STACK and SERVICE_KEY args. The subshell defers resolution to the moment of exec, avoiding the stale ID and parse-time-failure pitfalls of returning a resolved value at vars-resolution time."
msgstr "Swarm režiim - shell subshell, mis lahendab jooksva ülesande konteineri ID exec ajal, nt `\"$(/usr/bin/resolve-container-id mattermost mattermost)\"`. Swarm nimetab iga teenuse ``<stack>_<key>`` ja ei aktsepteeri prefiksi sobitamist; abistaja komponeerib selle nime STACKist ja SERVICE_KEY args. Subshell lükkab resolutsiooni edasi exec-hetkele, vältides aegunud ID-d ja parse-time-failure lõkse määratud väärtuse tagastamisel vars-lahutuse ajal."

# libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - the same reference, prefixed with the in-cluster registry host:port (e.g. ``manager.example.com:5000/mattermost/mattermost-team-edition:11.8.0``) when ``swarm.registry.host`` and ``swarm.registry.port`` are set. With no registry configured, swarm falls back to the un-prefixed form."
msgstr "Swarm mode - sama viide, millele eelliitetakse klastrisisene registrimasin:port (nt. ``manager.example.com:5000/mattermost/mattermost-team-edition:11.8.0``) millal ``swarm.registry.host`` ja ``swarm.registry.port`` on paigas. Kui registrit ei ole seadistatud, langeb parv tagasi määramata vormile."

