# libretranslate
msgid "Swarm-test only (called by the swarm matrix after provision). In swarm an embedded per-app database (``shared: false``) resolves to a per-app mariadb whose volume is NFS-backed with no placement pin — InnoDB on NFS plus a free-floating task is unsupported (locking, split-brain). Embedded DBs are a compose-only pattern. Flipping every consumer's DB service to ``shared: true`` routes it to the central svc-db-* provider (as the baseline variant does), so no per-app DB is scheduled in swarm."
msgstr "Ainult Swarm-test (kutsutud parvemaatriksi poolt pärast varustamist). Parves põimitud rakendusepõhine andmebaas (``shared: false``) lahendab rakendusepõhise mariadbi, mille maht on NFS-toega ilma paigutuspingita – InnoDB NFS-is pluss vabalt ujuv ülesanne on toetuseta (lukustus, aju murdosa)Hõlmatud DB-d on ainult komponeeritud muster. Flipping iga tarbija DB teenus ``shared: true`` tsentraalsesse svc-db...* pakkuja (nagu baasvariant), nii et parvel ei ole DB-d planeeritud."

# libretranslate
msgid "Swarm: the device grant renders in compose mode only, matching the cadvisor precedent, because `docker stack deploy` drops `devices`. An embodied device is single-node by definition, so this is consistent rather than a gap, but the swarm path of the agent roles is never exercised with the robot role present."
msgstr "Swarm: seadme grant renderdab ainult komponeerimisrežiimis, sobitades kadvisori pretsedenti, sest `docker stack deploy` tilgad `devices`. Kehastatud seade on määratluse järgi ühesõlmeline, nii et see on pigem järjepidev kui tühimik, kuid agendirollide sülemteed ei kasutata kunagi roboti rolliga."

