# libretranslate
msgid "The Infinito.Nexus API is a public, read-only REST service built with [FastAPI](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/). It answers every question an app built on Infinito.Nexus asks about the platform: which roles exist, what their metadata says, how they are categorised, which bundles combine them, what the history of the repository and its forks looks like, and how all of that reads in each of the 184 ISO 639-1 languages."
msgstr "Theo Infinito.Nexus API on avalik, ainult loetav REST teenus, mis on ehitatud [FastAPI](https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/). See vastab igale küsimusele, millele on ehitatud rakendus Infinito.Nexus küsib platvormi kohta: millised rollid on olemas, mida nende metaandmed ütlevad, kuidas neid kategoriseeritakse, millised kimbud neid ühendavad, milline on hoidla ja selle kahvlite ajalugu ja kuidas see kõik igas neist loeb 184 ISO 639-1 keeli."

# libretranslate
msgid "The Infinito.Nexus API is a public, read-only REST service built with `FastAPI <https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/>`__. It answers every question an app built on Infinito.Nexus asks about the platform: which roles exist, what their metadata says, how they are categorised, which bundles combine them, what the history of the repository and its forks looks like, and how all of that reads in each of the 184 ISO 639-1 languages."
msgstr "Theo Infinito.Nexus API on avalik, ainult loetav REST teenus, mis on ehitatud `FastAPI <https://fastapi.tiangolo.com/>`__. See vastab igale küsimusele, millele on ehitatud rakendus Infinito.Nexus küsib platvormi kohta: millised rollid on olemas, mida nende metaandmed ütlevad, kuidas neid kategoriseeritakse, millised kimbud neid ühendavad, milline on hoidla ja selle kahvlite ajalugu ja kuidas see kõik igas neist loeb 184 ISO 639-1 keeli."

# libretranslate
msgid "The Keycloak **Userinfo** preview for the user contains a `groups` array with the full path. If it does not, the scope is not reaching the userinfo endpoint and the mapping will not fire."
msgstr "Theo Keycloak **Kasutajainfo** Kasutaja eelvaatlus sisaldab `groups` terve tee. Kui see nii ei ole, ei jõua ulatus kasutajainfo lõpp-punkti ja kaardistamine ei käivitu."

# libretranslate
msgid "The Keycloak OIDC client for ERPNext is **auto-provisioned** via `web-app-keycloak`, consistent with every other OIDC-consuming role in the repo."
msgstr "Theo Keycloak OIDC klient ERPNext on **automaadiga** viadu `web-app-keycloak`, mis on kooskõlas kõigi muude OIDCd tarbivate rollidega repos."

# libretranslate
msgid "The Keycloak group tree behind these paths is materialised by a per-application group-ldap-mapper (roles/web-app-keycloak/tasks/update/05_per_app_mappers.yml), anchored at `/<group_root>/<application_id>` with `group.name.ldap.attribute=description`."
msgstr "Theo Keycloak Rühmapuu nende radade taga materialiseerub rakendusepõhise grupi-ldap-mapper abil (roles/web-app-keycloak/tasks/update/05_per_app_mappers.yml), ankurdatud `/<group_root>/<application_id>` koos `group.name.ldap.attribute=description`."

# libretranslate
msgid "The Keycloak group tree is built by **per-application** `group-ldap-mapper`s. Each deployed application gets one mapper anchored at `/roles/<application_id>` whose LDAP filter `(&(objectClass=groupOfNames)(cn=<application_id>-*))` surfaces only that application's role groups. The mapper uses the LDAP `description` attribute as the visible Keycloak group name, so the resulting group paths carry no redundant prefix."
msgstr "Theo Keycloak rühmapuu **taotluse kohta** `group-ldap-mapper`s. Iga rakendus saab ühe mapperi ankurdatud `/roles/<application_id>` mille LDAP filter `(&(objectClass=groupOfNames)(cn=<application_id>-*))` Ainult selle rakenduse rollirühmad. Mapper kasutab LDAP- i `description` atribuut nähtavana Keycloak grupi nimi, nii et tulemuseks olevad grupirajad ei kanna üleliigset prefiksi."

# libretranslate
msgid "The MCP surface ships disabled by default and is independent of the host role's `lifecycle`: a `beta` host role MUST NOT imply that its MCP surface is stable. An MCP surface is only considered validated once its acceptance criteria are met end to end."
msgstr "MCP pinnalaevad on vaikimisi välja lülitatud ja ei sõltu võõrustaja rollist. `lifecycle`: `beta` Peremeesroll EI TOHI tähendada, et selle MCP pind on stabiilne. MCP pind loetakse valideerituks alles siis, kui selle vastuvõetavuskriteeriumid on lõpuni täidetud."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The MDAD inventory is templated to enable a conservative-default bridge set plus Jitsi + Element Call. Bridge enablement is gated on `lookup('config', application_id, 'services.matrix.plugins.<bridge>')`. v1 default-ON set (operator-confirmed): `mautrix_signal`, `mautrix_telegram`, `mautrix_twitter`, `mautrix_slack`, `appservice_irc`, `heisenbridge`, `discord`, `gitter`, `hookshot`. Default-OFF (operator opts in): every bridge that needs a third-party API token the operator must obtain manually — `facebook`, `instagram`, `googlechat`, `mautrix_whatsapp`, `sms`, `appservice_kakaotalk`, and the superseded `mx_puppet_{slack,discord}`."
msgstr "MDAD-inventuur on mallitud, et võimaldada konservatiivse vaikesilla komplekti pluss Jitsi + Element Call. Silla võimaldamine on sisse lülitatud `lookup('config', application_id, 'services.matrix.plugins.<bridge>')`. V1 vaikimisi sisselülitatud oleku seade (käitaja poolt kinnitatud): `mautrix_signal`, `mautrix_telegram`, `mautrix_twitter`, `mautrix_slack`, `appservice_irc`, `heisenbridge`, `discord`, `gitter`, `hookshot`. Vaikimisi (operaator otsustab)Iga sild, mis vajab kolmandat osapoolt API läbipääsuloa peab käitaja saama käsitsi: `facebook`, `instagram`, `googlechat`, `mautrix_whatsapp`, `sms`, `appservice_kakaotalk`, ja asendatud `mx_puppet_{slack,discord}`."

