msgstr "Rakenduses kasutataval OIDC kliendil on `groups` kliendi määratlus **vaikimisi** ulatus (mittevalikuline). Kujundusmärkus [RBACi konstruktsioon](../../contributing/design/iam/rbac.md) selgitab, miks."

# libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC group path `/roles/web-app-openbao/<role>` already namespaces by application, so an `openbao-` prefix would be redundant, and the repo's other `meta/rbac.yml` files use bare role names."
msgstr "OIDC grupi asukoht `/roles/web-app-openbao/<role>` juba nimeruumid rakenduse järgi, seega `openbao-` eesliide oleks üleliigne ja repo teine `meta/rbac.yml` failid kasutavad tühiseid rollinimesid."

# libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC login + RBAC paths are covered by ``test-admin-oidc-login.js`` / ``test-rbac-roles.js``, the Discourse round-trip by ``test-discourse-roundtrip.js``."
msgstr "OIDC sisselogimise + RBAC teed on kaetud ``test-admin-oidc-login.js`` / ``test-rbac-roles.js``, Discourse edasi-tagasi ``test-discourse-roundtrip.js``."

# libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC login + RBAC paths are covered by `test-admin-oidc-login.js` / `test-rbac-roles.js`, the Discourse round-trip by `test-discourse-roundtrip.js`."
msgstr "OIDC sisselogimise + RBAC teed on kaetud `test-admin-oidc-login.js` / `test-rbac-roles.js`, Discourse edasi-tagasi `test-discourse-roundtrip.js`."

# libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC login entry points (`oidc_login`, `sociallogin`, `user_oidc`) are mandatory because they gate SSO login: when one of them is the selected flavor and the system hides the native login form, an un-installed OIDC app leaves the instance with no usable login path. Failing at install time surfaces the version-pin mismatch immediately rather than as a downstream login timeout in the Playwright e2e suite."
msgstr "OIDC sisselogimispunktid (`oidc_login`, `sociallogin`, `user_oidc`) on kohustuslikud, sest nad lukustavad SSO sisselogimise: kui üks neist on valitud maitse ja süsteem peidab loomuliku sisselogimisvormi, jätab installimata OIDC rakendus eksemplari ilma kasutatava sisselogimisrajata. Paigaldamise aja ebaõnnestumine pinnab versiooni-pini ebakõla kohe, mitte Playwrightis sisselogimise aegumisajana.2e sviit."

# libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC role's `groups_claim` (JSON-pointer capable) names the claim holding the user's groups; those values resolve against identity groups of `type=external` via group aliases on the auth mount, which carry the policies."
msgstr "OIDC rollid `groups_claim` (JSON-punktiseade) nimetab nõude, mis hoiab kasutaja rühmi; need väärtused lahendavad `type=external` grupi varjunimede kaudu auth mount'il, mis kannavad poliitikat."

# libretranslate
msgid "The OIDC username claim is paired with the LDAP login attribute by design. See [ldap.md](ldap.md) for the LDAP-side rule."
msgstr "OIDC kasutajanime nõue on disaini järgi seotud LDAP- i sisselogimise atribuudiga. Vaata [ldap.md](ldap.md) LDAP-poole reegel."

