# libretranslate
msgid "The PostgreSQL database is backed up by the central backup roles; the asset volume is backup-ready by convention."
msgstr "Theo PostgreSQL andmebaasi toetavad kesksed varundamise rollid; varade maht on tavapäraselt varundatud."

# libretranslate
msgid "The Pull Request MUST be linked to the related work item in [project.infinito.nexus](https://project.infinito.nexus/) and back."
msgstr "Tõmmake taotlus PEAB olema seotud vastava tööga [project.infinito.nexus](https://project.infinito.nexus/) ja tagasi."

# libretranslate
msgid "The Python helper is intentionally self-contained and unit-testable"
msgstr "Pythoni abimees on tahtlikult iseseisev ja ühiktestitav"

# libretranslate
msgid "The README section :file:`scripts/github/guide/compose_deploy.sh` replays. A role without it has no instructions to test."
msgstr "Osa README :file:`scripts/github/guide/compose_deploy.sh` kordusi. Rollil ilma selleta pole juhiseid testimiseks."

# libretranslate
msgid "The REST API answers ``inputs: null`` for a finished workflow_dispatch, so the inputs are recovered from the run itself: short ones from the title (``config_from_title``), the long ones from a called job's log (``inputs_from_jobs``), which the title truncates."
msgstr "REST API vastuseid ``inputs: null`` lõpetatud workflow_dispatch, nii et sisendid taastatakse jooksust endast: lühikesed pealkirjast (``config_from_title``), pikad nimega töö logist (``inputs_from_jobs``), mida pealkiri kärbib."

# libretranslate
msgid "The Root CA private key is generated **unencrypted** (automation-friendly). Protect file permissions."
msgstr "Juur CA privaatvõti genereeritakse **krüpteerimata** (automaatikasõbralik). Kaitsta failide õigusi."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SPOT declaration with the scope's override merged over it."
msgstr "SPOT-deklaratsioon koos rakendusala tühistamisega liideti sellega."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SPOT is ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.architectures``, next to ``modes``: both state what the role CAN do, which is why the deploy matrix narrows a row by them. ``meta/tests.yml`` is the other kind of statement - what CI should skip exercising - and an image that exists for one architecture only is not a testing preference."
msgstr "SPOT ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.architectures``, kõrval ``modes``: mõlemad ütlevad, mida roll CAN teeb, mistõttu juurutamismaatriks kitsendab nende poolt rida. ``meta/tests.yml`` See on teist tüüpi väide - mida CI peaks vahele harjutama - ja pilt, mis eksisteerib ainult ühe arhitektuuri jaoks, ei ole testimiseelistus."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SPOT is ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.modes.<mode>.enabled``. A missing ``modes`` block, a missing ``<mode>`` entry, or a missing ``enabled`` key all mean the role participates in that mode (default ``True``)."
msgstr "SPOT ``meta/services.yml.<primary_entity>.modes.<mode>.enabled``. Kadunud ``modes`` blokk, kadunud ``<mode>`` sissekanne või puuduv ``enabled`` Peamine kõik tähendab, et roll selles režiimis osaleb (vaikimisi ``True``)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SPOT is parsed with a plain-string line parser instead of PyYAML: the env build runs during bootstrap (make install-system-python) before any Python dependency exists, so this module must stay stdlib-only. Only plain ``KEY: \"value\"`` entries can be read this way; a Jinja expression or a missing key is a hard error."
msgstr "SPOT parseeritakse PyYAMLi asemel tavalise stringijoone parseriga: env ehitamine jookseb bootstrapi ajal (make install- system- python) enne, kui Pythoni sõltuvus on olemas, peab see moodul jääma ainult stdlibiks. Ainult puhas ``KEY: \"value\"`` sissekandeid saab lugeda nii; Jinja avaldis või puuduv võti on kõva viga."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SSE session travels through the shared Redis channel layer, so the stream and the message POST may land on different replicas."
msgstr "SSE seanss rändab läbi jagatud Redis kanalikiht, nii et voog ja sõnum POST võivad maanduda erinevatel koopiatel."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SSO (``sociallogin``) and LDAP (``user_ldap``) login surfaces are covered by the OIDC/LDAP Playwright specs (requirements 017/018)."
msgstr "SSO (``sociallogin``) LDAP (``user_ldap``) sisselogimispinnad on kaetud OIDC/LDAP Playwrighti spetsifikatsioonidega (nõuded 017/018)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SSO (`sociallogin`) and LDAP (`user_ldap`) login surfaces are covered by the OIDC/LDAP Playwright specs (requirements 017/018)."
msgstr "SSO (`sociallogin`) LDAP (`user_ldap`) sisselogimispinnad on kaetud OIDC/LDAP Playwrighti spetsifikatsioonidega (nõuded 017/018)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The SSO back-channel pin, added automatically. On an onion deployment the OIDC endpoints handed to an application are public ``.onion`` authorities. That is right for the browser, which reaches them through Tor, but unroutable for the application's own server-side calls (code-to-token exchange, JWKS, userinfo): a container resolves ``.onion`` through Tor's resolver, not through DNS. Pinning the provider to a reachable address sends those calls over the local network to the proxy that already serves the vhost. Skipped unless the application has SSO enabled and the provider vhost is an ``.onion`` name, so it is a no-op on clearnet."
msgstr "SSO tagasikanali tihvt, mis lisatakse automaatselt. Sibula kasutamise korral on taotlusele esitatud OIDC näitajad avalikud ``.onion`` võimud. See on õige brauseri jaoks, mis jõuab nendeni Tori kaudu, kuid rakenduse enda serveripoolsete kõnede jaoks ei ole marsruutitav. (koodivahetus, JWKS, kasutajainfo): konteiner laheneb ``.onion`` Tori lahendaja kaudu, mitte DNS-i kaudu. Teenuseosutaja kinnitamine ligipääsetavale aadressile saadab need kõned üle kohaliku võrgu proxyle, mis juba teenindab vhosti. vahele jäetud, välja arvatud juhul, kui rakendusel on SSO lubatud ja pakkuja vhost on ``.onion`` nimi, nii et see on no-op Clearnetis."

# libretranslate
msgid "The Sphinx configuration, extensions and generators live in [web-app-docs](../../roles/web-app-docs/). Deploy that role to build and serve the site."
msgstr "Sphinxi konfiguratsioon, laiendused ja generaatorid elavad [web-app-docs](../../roles/web-app-docs/). Kasutage seda rolli saidi ehitamiseks ja teenindamiseks."

# libretranslate
msgid "The URL reachability check emits warning annotations for HTTP `429`, `500`, and `503` (rate-limited or temporarily unavailable) via [`utils.annotations.message`](../../../../utils/annotations/message.py)."
msgstr "URL-i juurdepääsetavuse kontroll väljastab HTTP-le hoiatusannotatsioonid `429`, `500`, ja `503` (piiratud või ajutiselt kättesaamatu määr) viadu [`utils.annotations.message`](../../../../utils/annotations/message.py)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The URL reachability check skips template placeholders and reserved local or example hosts such as `localhost` and `*.example`."
msgstr "URL-i juurdepääsetavuse kontroll jätab vahele malli kohatäitjad ja reserveeritud kohalikud või näidismajutajad, näiteks `localhost` ja `*.example`."

# libretranslate
msgid "The URL reachability check treats HTTP `401`, `403`, and `405` as reachable (auth-gated or method-restricted servers, not dead links)."
msgstr "URL- i juurdepääsetavuse kontroll käsitleb HTTP- d `401`, `403`, ja `405` ligipääsetavana (Auth-gated või method-limited servereid, mitte surnud linke)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The URL reachability check treats read and connect timeouts as warnings."
msgstr "URL-i juurdepääsetavuse kontroll käsitleb lugemise ja ühendamise aegumisi hoiatustena."

# libretranslate
msgid "The YAML key is the semantic short name. Each entry value MAY carry ``name`` (the docker volume name); when absent and ``type`` is ``volume``, callers default the docker name to the semantic key."
msgstr "YAML võti on semantiline lühike nimi. Iga kirje väärtus võib sisaldada ``name`` (doki mahu nimi); puudumise korral ja ``type`` on ``volume``, helistajad vaikimisi docker nimi semantiline võti."

# libretranslate
msgid "The Zammad helpdesk role completes its single-sign-on schema unification, with the variant matrix and Playwright test suite brought in line with the new shape."
msgstr "Theo Zammad kasutajatoe roll lõpetab oma ühe allkirjaga skeemi ühendamise, variantmaatriks ja Playwrighti testkomplekt viiakse kooskõlla uue kujuga."

# libretranslate
msgid "The [GitHub Actions self-hosted runner](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners/about-self-hosted-runners) is an agent that runs GitHub Actions workflow jobs on your own infrastructure instead of GitHub-hosted machines."
msgstr "Theo [GitHub Actions isehakanud jooksja](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners/about-self-hosted-runners) on agent, kes töötab GitHub Actions töövoo töökohti oma infrastruktuuri asemel GitHub hostitud masinad."

# libretranslate
msgid "The [alias](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/alias) repository is the RECOMMENDED way to define CLI shortcuts so frequently used commands do not have to be retyped. The effective repository is the `INFINITO_ALIAS_REPOSITORY` value in the generated `.env`."
msgstr "Theo [varjunime](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/alias) hoidla on CLI kiirklahvide määratlemiseks soovitatav viis, nii et sageli kasutatavaid käske ei pea uuesti sisestama. Tõhus hoidla on `INFINITO_ALIAS_REPOSITORY` genereeritud väärtus `.env`."

# libretranslate
msgid "The [lint.md](testing/lint.md) page covers repository-wide code quality expectations such as diff quality, maintainability, and conventions."
msgstr "Theo [lint.md](testing/lint.md) lehekülg hõlmab kogu hoidla koodi kvaliteediootusi, nagu diff kvaliteet, hooldatavus ja kokkulepped."

# libretranslate
msgid "The [per-role meta layout](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) already lists `addons`, `plugins`, and `modules` among the keys *inlined* under the primary service entity. This requirement promotes that concept to a first-class, per-file `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` topic (one file per addon, file root IS the addon spec), the same move requirement 011 made for `meta/info.yml` and requirement 008/009 made for other meta topics."
msgstr "Theo [rollide metapaigutus](../contributing/design/role/services/layout.md) juba nimekirjad `addons`, `plugins`, ja `modules` võtmete *vooderdatud* esmase teenuse üksuse all. See nõue edendab seda kontseptsiooni esimese klassi failide kaupa `meta/addons/<addon_id>.yml` teema (üks fail addoni kohta, faili juur IS addon spec), sama kolimisnõue 011 tehtud `meta/info.yml` ja nõuded 008/009 tehtud teistele metateemadele."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `.onion` is a **deploy-time input**: a CLI helper mints the v3 key offline during inventory build, vaults it, and sets `DOMAIN_PRIMARY`. It must NOT be a runtime fact — `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` is consumed at build time (LDAP base, CA, applications cache). The role restores the minted key into the hidden-service volume before Tor starts."
msgstr "Theo `.onion` on **käivitusaja sisend**: a CLI abimees vermib v3 võti offline ajal varude ehitamine, võlvide seda ja seab `DOMAIN_PRIMARY`. See ei tohi olla ajaline fakt – `DOMAIN_PRIMARY` tarbitakse ehitamise ajal (LDAP baas, CA, rakenduste vahemälu). Roll taastab vermitud võtme peidetud teenuse helitugevusse enne Tor käivitamist."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `@playwright/test` version pinned into the rendered `package.json` comes from `playwright.version` in `roles/test-e2e-playwright/meta/services.yml` via the `image_version` filter. That YAML value is the single source of truth for the Playwright version."
msgstr "Theo `@playwright/test` renderdatud versioon `package.json` pärineb `playwright.version` sisse `roles/test-e2e-playwright/meta/services.yml` läbi `image_version` filter. See YAML väärtus on Playwrighti versiooni ainus tõeallikas."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `API.cloudflare.api_token` value (declared in `group_vars/all/18_api.yml`, read via `lookup('api', 'cloudflare.api_token')`) must contain a valid Cloudflare API Token.   This token is used for all DNS operations and ACME (SSL/TLS certificate) challenges that require access to your Cloudflare-managed domains."
msgstr "Theo `API.cloudflare.api_token` väärtust (kuulutatud `group_vars/all/18_api.yml`, lugeda `lookup('api', 'cloudflare.api_token')`) peab sisaldama kehtivat Cloudflare'i API Token. Seda märki kasutatakse kõigi DNS-operatsioonide ja ACME jaoks. (SSL/TLS sertifikaat) Probleemid, mis nõuavad juurdepääsu teie Cloudflare hallatavatele domeenidele."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `Bash(*)` allow grants broad access to the `docker` CLI (alongside every other shell command) under the assumption that no production containers share the host. Non-mutating-image subcommands (`rm`, `kill`, `stop`, `system prune`, `volume rm`, `cp`) can disrupt or destroy container state. Under test-only usage, the blast radius is bounded to ephemeral state that can be recreated from the compose stack."
msgstr "Theo `Bash(*)` võimaldada toetuste laialdast kättesaadavust `docker` CLI (kõigi teiste shellikäskude kõrval) eeldusel, et ükski tootmiskonteiner ei ole peremeesorganismiga sama. Mittemuteeruvad pildi alamkäsud (`rm`, `kill`, `stop`, `system prune`, `volume rm`, `cp`) See võib häirida või hävitada konteineri olekut. Ainult testide kasutamise korral piirdub lööklaine raadius lühiajalise olekuga, mida saab komponeeritud virnast uuesti luua."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `Bash(*)` allow lets the agent run any Makefile target without prompting. The `Makefile` is checked into git and reviewed on every pull request, so targets themselves are trusted. Every action a target performs still runs inside the sandbox."
msgstr "Theo `Bash(*)` Võimaldab agendil käivitada Makefile'i sihtmärgi ilma seda küsimata. Theo `Makefile` kontrollitakse git ja vaadatakse üle iga tõmbetaotluse puhul, nii et sihtmärgid ise on usaldusväärsed. Iga tegevus, mida sihtmärk sooritab, jookseb endiselt liivakasti sees."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The `Corefile.tmpl` MUST be the source of truth. It is rendered to `Corefile` by [coredns.py](../../cli/administration/deploy/development/coredns.py), which substitutes its `${VAR}` placeholders in-process, using values from `.env` (generated from [default.env](../../default.env), overridable through the CLI's environment)."
msgstr "Theo `Corefile.tmpl` Peab olema tõe allikas. See on tehtud `Corefile` poolt [coredns.py](../../cli/administration/deploy/development/coredns.py), mis asendab `${VAR}` Kohatäitjad protsessis, kasutades väärtusi `.env` (genereeritud [default.env](../../default.env), mis on CLI keskkonnas ülekaalukad)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `GitHub Actions self-hosted runner <https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners/about-self-hosted-runners>`__ is an agent that runs GitHub Actions workflow jobs on your own infrastructure instead of GitHub-hosted machines."
msgstr "Theo `GitHub Actions self-hosted runner <https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners/about-self-hosted-runners>`__ on agent, kes töötab GitHub Actions töövoo töökohti oma infrastruktuuri asemel GitHub hostitud masinad."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `Makefile` is the human-facing command surface for the repo. It MUST expose stable targets that people and CI are meant to run directly."
msgstr "Theo `Makefile` on inimsuunas repo käsupind. See peab paljastama stabiilsed eesmärgid, mida inimesed ja CI on mõeldud otse juhtima."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `OIDC` tree is a lazy group_var: it resolves in the consuming role's context, so the issuer family-aligns to that consumer (clearnet page → clearnet issuer, onion page → onion issuer). Inventory overrides therefore live under `OIDC_OVERRIDE:` — an inventory-level `OIDC:` block would shadow the lazy resolution and is rejected by a constructor assert."
msgstr "Theo `OIDC` puu on laisk group_var: see laheneb tarbiva rolli kontekstis, nii et emitent viib selle tarbijaga kokku (Clearnet page → Clearnet emitent, sibulaleht → sibula emitent). Seetõttu on varude tühistamine `OIDC_OVERRIDE:` — inventuuri tasandil `OIDC:` Blokk varjutaks laisat resolutsiooni ja konstruktori väide lükkab selle tagasi."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `Options` rule is what keeps a swarm host with NFS-backed volumes on the live copy (see [NFS-backed volumes](#nfs-backed-volumes)): such a volume is a separate filesystem, so a snapshot of the data root would capture it as an empty directory and the backup would succeed while holding nothing. The declaration is checked rather than the mount table, because docker mounts those volumes lazily and unmounts them when the last container stops."
msgstr "Theo `Options` Reegel on see, mis hoiab sülemasti NFS-i toetatud mahtudega otseülekandes (näha [NFSiga tagatud mahud](#nfs-backed-volumes)): selline maht on eraldi failisüsteem, nii et andmejuure hetkepilt jäädvustaks selle tühja kataloogina ja varukoopia õnnestuks, kui midagi ei hoia. Kinnitustabeli asemel kontrollitakse deklaratsiooni, sest dokker paigaldab need mahud laisalt ja lahutab need, kui viimane konteiner peatub."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION` variable selects distro-specific package installation tasks (Debian, Ubuntu, Arch Linux, or Fedora/EL). The role is designed to be driven by the `make runner-ci-deploy` target; see the end-to-end guide below."
msgstr "Theo `RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION` muutuja valib distrospetsiifilised paketi paigaldusülesanded (Debian, Ubuntu, Arch Linux või Fedora/EL). Rolli eesmärk on juhtida `make runner-ci-deploy` Sihtmärk; vaata allpool olevat otsast lõpuni juhendit."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``(fqcn, version)`` pairs a requirements file declares, in order."
msgstr "Theo ``(fqcn, version)`` paaris nõuete fail deklareerib järjekorras."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``(owner/repo, version)`` ``roles/sys-lint`` pins for *tool*."
msgstr "Theo ``(owner/repo, version)`` ``roles/sys-lint`` nõelu *tööriist*."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``(owner/repo, version)`` an installer should fetch for *tool*."
msgstr "Theo ``(owner/repo, version)`` paigaldaja *tööriist*."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``API`` mapping as declared in the group_vars SPOT."
msgstr "Theo ``API`` kaardistamine vastavalt group_vars SPOT."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``INFINITO_DOMAIN`` fallback declared in ``default.env``."
msgstr "Theo ``INFINITO_DOMAIN`` varuosa on deklareeritud ``default.env``."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``Options`` rule is what keeps a swarm host with NFS-backed volumes on the live copy (see `NFS-backed volumes <#nfs-backed-volumes>`__): such a volume is a separate filesystem, so a snapshot of the data root would capture it as an empty directory and the backup would succeed while holding nothing. The declaration is checked rather than the mount table, because docker mounts those volumes lazily and unmounts them when the last container stops."
msgstr "Theo ``Options`` Reegel on see, mis hoiab sülemasti NFS-i toetatud mahtudega otseülekandes (näha `NFS-backed volumes <#nfs-backed-volumes>`__): selline maht on eraldi failisüsteem, nii et andmejuure hetkepilt jäädvustaks selle tühja kataloogina ja varukoopia õnnestuks, kui midagi ei hoia. Kinnitustabeli asemel kontrollitakse deklaratsiooni, sest dokker paigaldab need mahud laisalt ja lahutab need, kui viimane konteiner peatub."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION`` variable selects distro-specific package installation tasks (Debian, Ubuntu, Arch Linux, or Fedora/EL). The role is designed to be driven by the ``make runner-ci-deploy`` target; see the end-to-end guide below."
msgstr "Theo ``RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION`` muutuja valib distrospetsiifilised paketi paigaldusülesanded (Debian, Ubuntu, Arch Linux või Fedora/EL). Rolli eesmärk on juhtida ``make runner-ci-deploy`` Sihtmärk; vaata allpool olevat otsast lõpuni juhendit."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is **not** blocked: `tasks/04_admin.yml <./tasks/04_admin.yml>`__ seeds a native OpenProject account whose password is the Keycloak administrator secret, so the journey runs in every variant. The ``biber`` persona is blocked only in the ``sso: false`` variants — OpenProject is seeded with the administrator alone, and ``biber`` is auto-provisioned exclusively through the oauth2-proxy trusted-header bridge onto the LDAP auth source, which those variants remove. Both flags are declared explicitly in `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__."
msgstr "Theo ``administrator`` persona **ei** blokeeritud: `tasks/04_admin.yml <./tasks/04_admin.yml>`__ põlisrahvaste seemned OpenProject konto, mille parool on Keycloak Administraatori saladus, nii et teekond kulgeb igas variandis. Theo ``biber`` isik on blokeeritud ainult ``sso: false`` variandid – OpenProject on külvatud koos administraatoriga ja ``biber`` Automaatne varustamine toimub ainult suudme kaudu2-proxy Trust-header sild LDAP auth allikale, mille need variandid eemaldavad. Mõlemad lipud on selgesõnaliselt deklareeritud `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is additionally blocked because this role never creates a BookWyrm staff account. ``files/sso/header_auth.py`` provisions proxied identities with ``create_user(...)`` and no ``is_staff`` flag, and no task promotes an existing account, so the administrator arrives as an ordinary member with no admin surface to exercise."
msgstr "Theo ``administrator`` Isiksus on samuti blokeeritud, sest see roll ei loo kunagi BookWyrm personalikonto. ``files/sso/header_auth.py`` sätted, millega muudetakse isikusamasust ``create_user(...)`` ja ei ``is_staff`` lipp ja ükski ülesanne ei reklaami olemasolevat kontot, nii et administraator saabub tavalise liikmena, kellel pole administraatoripinda."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is blocked because Decidim’s admin is a Devise account seeded by ``files/ruby/ensure_admin_user.rb`` and Devise signs in by e-mail address. The role’s Playwright env therefore exposes ``ADMIN_EMAIL`` and no ``ADMIN_USERNAME``, which is the variable the shared admin helper reads."
msgstr "Theo ``administrator`` isik on blokeeritud, sest Decidimadmin on Devise konto, mis on külvatud ``files/ruby/ensure_admin_user.rb`` Kirjutage oma allkirjad e-posti aadressile. Playwrighti env näitab, et ``ADMIN_EMAIL`` ja ei ``ADMIN_USERNAME``, mis on muutuja, mida jagatud administraatori abiline loeb."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is blocked only while SSO is off. In that configuration ``PROXY_HEADER_SSO`` is false, so the trusted-header bridge is inactive and the sole account is the Django superuser bootstrapped by ``tasks/01_manager_ops.yml`` via ``files/bootstrap_admin.py``, whose identifier is the ORM ``username`` rather than the e-mail Baserow’s own sign-in form asks for. With SSO enabled the header bridge supplies the session and the persona runs."
msgstr "Theo ``administrator`` Persona on blokeeritud ainult siis, kui SSO on välja lülitatud. Selles konfiguratsioonis ``PROXY_HEADER_SSO`` on väär, nii et usaldusväärse päise sild on mitteaktiivne ja ainus konto on Django superkasutaja, keda käivitab ``tasks/01_manager_ops.yml`` viadu ``files/bootstrap_admin.py``, mille tunnus on ORM ``username`` e-posti asemel BaserowTeie enda sisselogimisvorm küsib. SSO-ga võimaldatud päise sild varustab sessiooni ja persona jookseb."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``biber`` and ``administrator`` Playwright personas are gated on ``services.sso.enabled``. When SSO is off, ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ renders ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. Two reasons:"
msgstr "Theo ``biber`` ja ``administrator`` Näitekirjanikud on sisse lülitatud ``services.sso.enabled``. Kui SSO on välja lülitatud, ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ renders ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``Kaks põhjust:"

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``biber`` persona logs in through OIDC without trouble; what it cannot do is log out. Decidim’s sign-out is a ``data-method`` link inside the account dropdown, so the role’s own tests navigate to ``/users/sign_out`` directly rather than clicking a button the shared helper could find."
msgstr "Theo ``biber`` persona logib OIDC kaudu sisse ilma probleemideta; mida ta ei saa teha, on välja logida. Decidimi allkirjastamine on ``data-method`` link sees konto rippumine, nii rolli enda testid navigeerida ``/users/sign_out`` Selle asemel, et klõpsata nuppu, mida jagatud abiline võiks leida."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``context_agent`` and ``contextagentmcp`` services in ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ render only while ``mcp.enabled`` is true. The first runs ``ghcr.io/nextcloud/context_agent``, listens on its internal port for AppAPI only, and shares ``credentials.context_agent_app_secret`` with the ExApp registration as ``APP_SECRET``. The second is the adapter sidecar, built from the staged ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` context, read-only with every capability dropped, and it is the only MCP endpoint clients are given."
msgstr "Theo ``context_agent`` ja ``contextagentmcp`` teenuseid ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ render only while ``mcp.enabled`` is true. The first runs ``ghcr.io/nextcloud/context_agent``, listens on its internal port for AppAPI only, and shares ``credentials.context_agent_app_secret`` with the ExApp registration as ``APP_SECRET``. The second is the adapter sidecar, built from the staged ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` Kontekst, ainult loetav, iga võimekus on langenud, ja see on ainus MCP lõpp-punkti klient on antud."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``dashboard`` service in ``meta/services.yml`` is only a consumer tile pointing at MIG’s canonical domain; it does not host MIG. The role’s contract is fully carried by the reachability, canonical-domain and content-type scenarios in ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``, plus the guest persona. The path back to the generic personas is an authenticated MIG surface, which upstream does not have."
msgstr "Theo ``dashboard`` teenistuses ``meta/services.yml`` on ainult tarbijaplaat, mis osutab MIGKanooniline domeen; see ei majuta MIGRollilepingut täidavad täielikult ligipääsetavuse, kanoonilise domeeni ja sisu tüüpi stsenaariumid. ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``, pluss külalisisik. Tagasitee geneeriliste isikute juurde on autenditud MIG pinnale, mida ülesvoolu ei ole."

