# libretranslate
msgid "The actual app deploy runs inside a **sealed throwaway Docker daemon** and is torn down on exit, so the host's own stack is never touched. Several runners can share one host (or coexist with other workloads) safely."
msgstr "Tegelik rakendus töötab sees a **Dockeri deemon** Ja see rebitakse maha väljumisel, nii et võõrustaja enda virna ei puutu kunagi. Mitmed jooksjad saavad jagada ühte hosti (või eksisteerida koos teiste töökoormustega) ohutult."

# libretranslate
msgid "The adapter `digest` pins nothing today. All ten `implementation: adapter` roles carry the identical placeholder `sha256:` followed by sixty-four zeros, the schema only checks that prefix, and nothing outside the tests reads the field: the running image is resolved through `lookup('container_image', …)` from `services.mcp-adapter.image`. The immutable-source guarantee is therefore declared and not in force, so a lint that rejects a placeholder digest MUST land together with real digests rather than before them."
msgstr "Adapter `digest` Täna pole midagi. Kõik kümme `implementation: adapter` rollid kannavad identset kohatäitjat `sha256:` millele järgneb kuuskümmend neli nulli, kontrollib skeem ainult seda prefiksi ja miski väljaspool teste ei loe välja: töötav pilt lahendatakse läbi `lookup('container_image', …)` pärit `services.mcp-adapter.image`. Seega deklareeritakse muutumatu allika garantii ja see ei kehti, nii et lint, mis lükkab tagasi kohaomaniku seedimist, PEAB maad koos tegelike seedimistega, mitte enne neid."

# libretranslate
msgid "The adapter is what bounds that. [`files/mcp/tools.json`](./files/mcp/tools.json) names the nine read tools of `calendar`, `contacts` and `files` — the three categories whose upstream `is_available` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. `svc-ai-mcp-adapter` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked `mutating` while `mutating_tools_enabled` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract's `schema_sha256` does not match the file. The refusal happens in the sidecar, so it holds for every client regardless of what each renders locally."
msgstr "Adapter on see, mis seda piirab. [`files/mcp/tools.json`](./files/mcp/tools.json) nimetab üheksa lugemisvahendit `calendar`, `contacts` ja `files` – kolm kategooriat, mille eeletapis `is_available` on tingimusteta, nii et komplekt ei sõltu sellest, milliseid vabatahtlikke rakendusi installib. `svc-ai-mcp-adapter` Keeldub mis tahes tööriistast väljaspool seda loendit ja mis tahes märgistatud tööriistast `mutating` ajal `mutating_tools_enabled` See on vale ja see keeldub üldse alustamast, kui leping on `schema_sha256` ei sobi failiga. Keeldumine toimub külgkorvis, nii et see kehtib iga kliendi jaoks, olenemata sellest, mida igaüks teeb kohapeal."

# libretranslate
msgid "The adapter is what bounds that. ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ names the nine read tools of ``calendar``, ``contacts`` and ``files`` — the three categories whose upstream ``is_available`` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked ``mutating`` while ``mutating_tools_enabled`` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract’s ``schema_sha256`` does not match the file. The refusal happens in the sidecar, so it holds for every client regardless of what each renders locally."
msgstr "Adapter on see, mis seda piirab. ```files/mcp/tools.json`` <./files/mcp/tools.json>`__ names the nine read tools of ``calendar``, ``contacts`` and ``files`` — the three categories whose upstream ``is_available`` is unconditional, so the set does not vary with which optional apps a deployment installs. ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` refuses any tool outside that list and any tool marked ``mutating`` while ``mutating_tools_enabled`` is false, and it refuses to start at all if the contract’s ``schema_sha256`` ei sobi failiga. Keeldumine toimub külgkorvis, nii et see kehtib iga kliendi jaoks, olenemata sellest, mida igaüks teeb kohapeal."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The adapter presents `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY` to the provider in the header named by `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_HEADER` (default `Authorization`), formatted by `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_FORMAT` (default `Bearer {key}`, where `{key}` is the credential)."
msgstr "Adapter esitleb `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_KEY` päises, mille on nimetanud `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_HEADER` (vaikimisi `Authorization`), vormindatud `ADAPTER_UPSTREAM_AUTH_FORMAT` (vaikimisi `Bearer {key}`, kus `{key}` mandaat)."

