# libretranslate
msgid "The allowlist covers the `Bash(*)` wildcard plus the non-Bash tools (`Read`, `Edit`, `Write`, `WebSearch`) and per-domain `WebFetch` entries (the wildcard form is inert, see row below). The real gating for Bash lives in the `ask` and `deny` lists below: mutating `gh`/`docker`/`git` shapes land in `ask`, and structurally destructive shapes (`rm -rf*`, `sudo*`, shell loops, `git push --force*`, mutating `gh api` verbs, etc.) are blocked outright by `deny`. The sandbox (`allowWrite`, `denyRead`, `allowedDomains`) bounds the blast radius of everything that does execute."
msgstr "Lubatud nimekiri hõlmab `Bash(*)` metamärk ja mitte-Bashi tööriistad (`Read`, `Edit`, `Write`, `WebSearch`) ja domeenide kaupa `WebFetch` sissekandeid (metamärgi vorm on inertne, vt rida allpool)Bash'i tõeline gating elab `ask` ja `deny` järgmised loetelud: mutatsioon `gh`/`docker`/`git` kujundab maad `ask`ja struktuurilt hävitavad kujud (`rm -rf*`, `sudo*`, kestasilmused, `git push --force*`, mutatsiooni `gh api` verbid jne.) blokeeritakse `deny`Liivakast (`allowWrite`, `denyRead`, `allowedDomains`) Piirab plahvatuse raadiust kõiges, mis täide viiakse."

# libretranslate
msgid "The anonymous volume cleanup service."
msgstr "Anonüümne köitepuhastusteenus."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ansible flavor maps each true flag to the matching ``matrix_<bridge>_enabled`` MDAD var; the compose flavor builds the ``MATRIX_BRIDGES`` loop from the enabled ``mechanism: bridge`` addons (see Addons below)."
msgstr "Ansible Maitse kaardistab iga tõelise lipu sobivale ``matrix_<bridge>_enabled`` MDAD var; komponeeritud maitse ehitab ``MATRIX_BRIDGES`` silmus lubatud ``mechanism: bridge`` lisandeid (Vt Addons allpool)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ansible flavor maps each true flag to the matching `matrix_<bridge>_enabled` MDAD var; the compose flavor builds the `MATRIX_BRIDGES` loop from the enabled `mechanism: bridge` addons (see Addons below)."
msgstr "Ansible Maitse kaardistab iga tõelise lipu sobivale `matrix_<bridge>_enabled` MDAD var; komponeeritud maitse ehitab `MATRIX_BRIDGES` silmus lubatud `mechanism: bridge` lisandeid (Vt Addons allpool)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ansible-flavor tasks render an MDAD inventory under `{{ instance_dir }}mdad/inventory/host_vars/matrix.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}/vars.yml` from a Jinja template (`templates/flavor/ansible/mdad-vars.yml.j2`). The infinito-nexus role then invokes MDAD via `ansible.builtin.command` running `ansible-playbook -i inventory/hosts setup.yml --tags={{ playbook_tags }}` against that checkout."
msgstr "Hea maitsega ülesanded muudavad MDAD-i inventuuri `{{ instance_dir }}mdad/inventory/host_vars/matrix.{{ DOMAIN_PRIMARY }}/vars.yml` Jinja mallilt (`templates/flavor/ansible/mdad-vars.yml.j2`). Infinito-nexuse roll käivitab seejärel MDAD `ansible.builtin.command` jookseb `ansible-playbook -i inventory/hosts setup.yml --tags={{ playbook_tags }}` kassasse."

# libretranslate
msgid "The app does not require sessions or queues (rarely safe)"
msgstr "Rakendus ei nõua sessioone ega järjekordi (harva ohutu)"

# libretranslate
msgid "The app password never reaches a client. Clients present ``credentials.mcp_bearer`` to the sidecar; the sidecar presents the app password upstream. Revoking one does not revoke the other."
msgstr "Rakenduse parool ei jõua kunagi kliendini. Kliendid kohal ``credentials.mcp_bearer`` külgkorvi; külgkorv esitab rakenduse parooli ülesvoolu. Ühe tühistamine ei tühista teist."

# libretranslate
