# libretranslate
msgid "The clearnet resolver stays as a second entry so that losing dnsmasq costs onion names rather than all name resolution. Duplicates are dropped: where the bridge *is* the clearnet resolver, emitting it twice makes daemon.json differ between a run before and a run after ``docker0`` exists, and that difference restarts the container runtime underneath a live stack."
msgstr "Clearneti lahendaja jääb teiseks sisenemiseks, nii et dnsmasqi kaotamine maksab sibulate nimesid, mitte kõiki nime resolutsioone. Duplikaadid langevad: kus sild *on* Clearneti lahendaja, mis saadab selle kaks korda daemon.json Erinevus enne ja pärast jooksmist ``docker0`` on olemas ja see erinevus taaskäivitab konteineri käitusaja elava virna all."

