# libretranslate
msgid "The generic playwright biber and administrator personas are blocked via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` (req 019 Rule 11 explicit opt-out). Bluesky's social-app is a mobile-first SPA whose logout / account control sits behind a profile menu the auth-surface check cannot reach. The bespoke \"OIDC: oauth2-proxy + login-broker drop a Bluesky session into social-app via Keycloak (variant A+)\" test and its LDAP-variant counterpart in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` already verify both personas authenticate correctly (BSKY_STORAGE.accessJwt is present after the broker handoff). Once a stable selector for the social-app profile menu lands upstream, drop the opt-outs and let the persona helpers drive the dashboard → app → logout journey end-to-end."
msgstr "Üldised näitekirjanikud biber ja administraatorid on blokeeritud `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` ja `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` sisse `templates/playwright.env.j2` (req 019 Reegel 11 selgesõnaline loobumine). Bluesky's Social-app on mobiilne esimene SPA, mille väljalogimine / kontokontroll asub profiilimenüü taga, mille autentimise-pinna kontroll ei jõua. Eritellimusel \"OIDC: oauth2- proxy + sisselogimismaakleri tilk a Bluesky seanss sotsiaalrakendusse Keycloak (variant A+)\" test ja selle LDAP-variandi vaste `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` kontrollida mõlema isiku autentimist õigesti (BSKY_STORAGE.accessJwt on kohal pärast maakleri üleandmist)Kui sotsiaalse rakenduse profiili menüü stabiilne valija maandub ülesvoolu, loobuge ja laske persona abistajatel juhtida armatuurlauda → rakendus → väljalogimine teekond otsast lõpuni."

