msgstr "Integratsioon peab eristama kahte suunda:"

# libretranslate
msgid "The inventory itself is the bundle."
msgstr "Inventuur ise on kogum."

# libretranslate
msgid "The inverse of every other scenario, and deliberately so. Formalised as its own role in [034-svc-ai-robot.md](034-svc-ai-robot.md). Here Hermes is given full rights to explore and drive **one dedicated machine** so it can map its own hardware and act in the physical world: the robot platform idea. This is only coherent under Decision #12."
msgstr "Iga teise stsenaariumi pöördväärtus ja seda teadlikult. Vormistatud oma rollina [034-svc-ai-robot.md](034-svc-ai-robot.md). Siin antakse Hermesile täielikud õigused uurida ja sõita **spetsiaalne masin** et ta saaks kaardistada oma riistvara ja tegutseda füüsilises maailmas: robotplatvormi idee. See on kooskõlas ainult otsusega #12."

# libretranslate
msgid "The inverse of what :func:`assign` builds, kept next to it so the two cannot drift: consumers that hand-rolled their own regex over raw role ids silently matched nothing once job titles carried display names, and every failure went unreported."
msgstr "Mille vastupidine :func:`assign` ehitab, mida hoitakse selle kõrval, et need kaks ei saaks triivida: tarbijad, kes rullid oma regexi üle toores rolli ID-d, vaikisid midagi, kui ametinimetused kandsid kuvanimesid, ja iga ebaõnnestumine jäi teatamata."

# libretranslate
msgid "The job log is the source: it records all inputs verbatim, including the ones the title renders as a glyph and the ones it renders not at all. The title fills the gaps when a log is unreadable."
msgstr "Töölogi on allikas: see salvestab kõik sisendid sõna-sõnalt, sealhulgas need, mida pealkiri renderdab glüüfina ja need, mida ta üldse ei renderda. Pealkiri täidab lüngad, kui logi on loetamatu."

# libretranslate
msgid "The journey is covered bespoke in ``files/playwright/test-sso-login.js``, which seeds the landing flag, clicks the GitLab-slot link, verifies the channel view, and signs out via ``/logout``; ``files/playwright/test-biber-dm-administrator.js`` adds the peer exchange. The path back to the generic personas is an SSO control whose accessible name matches the shared matcher."
msgstr "Teekond on kaetud vastavalt ``files/playwright/test-sso-login.js``, mis külvab maandumislippu, klikib GitLab-slot link, kontrollib kanali vaadet ja logib välja ``/logout``; ``files/playwright/test-biber-dm-administrator.js`` lisab vastastikuse vahetuse. Tagasitee üldiste isikuteni on SSO juhtseade, mille ligipääsetav nimi vastab ühisele sobitajale."

# libretranslate
msgid "The journey is covered bespoke in `files/playwright/test-sso-login.js`, which seeds the landing flag, clicks the GitLab-slot link, verifies the channel view, and signs out via `/logout`; `files/playwright/test-biber-dm-administrator.js` adds the peer exchange. The path back to the generic personas is an SSO control whose accessible name matches the shared matcher."
msgstr "Teekond on kaetud vastavalt `files/playwright/test-sso-login.js`, mis külvab maandumislippu, klikib GitLab-slot link, kontrollib kanali vaadet ja logib välja `/logout`; `files/playwright/test-biber-dm-administrator.js` lisab vastastikuse vahetuse. Tagasitee üldiste isikuteni on SSO juhtseade, mille ligipääsetav nimi vastab ühisele sobitajale."

# libretranslate
msgid "The journey itself is not dropped. [`files/playwright/test-admin-native.js`](./files/playwright/test-admin-native.js) drives it through Shopware's own selectors: an authenticated backend assertion, then logout through the user-actions toggle and back to the login form. `SSO_SERVICE_ENABLED` selects how it signs in — through the `a.heptacom-admin-open-auth--button` provider link that AdminOpenAuth appends into `.sw-login__content` when SSO is on, through the native password form when it is off. The `guest` persona and the role-local reachability, TLS and HSTS assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Teekond ise ei jää pooleli. [`files/playwright/test-admin-native.js`](./files/playwright/test-admin-native.js) sõidutab Shopwareoma valijad: autenditud taustaprogrammi kinnitus, seejärel logige kasutaja toimingute kaudu sisse ja tagasi sisselogimisvormi. `SSO_SERVICE_ENABLED` Valib, kuidas sisse logida - läbi `a.heptacom-admin-open-auth--button` teenusepakkuja link, kuhu AdminOpenAuth lisab `.sw-login__content` kui SSO on sisse lülitatud, siis loomuliku paroolivormi kaudu, kui see on välja lülitatud. Theo `guest` persona ja rolli-kohalik ligipääsetavus, TLS ja HSTS väited töötavad tingimusteta."

# libretranslate
msgid "The journey itself is not dropped. [`files/playwright/test-native-login.js`](./files/playwright/test-native-login.js) drives both personas through Funkwhale's own chain: `/login`, the Keycloak round trip whenever the proxy gates that route, then Funkwhale's own sign-in form, an authenticated-surface assertion, and sign-out back to the anonymous state. It is skipped when `services.ldap.enabled` is false, because no persona holds a Funkwhale account in that variant. The `guest` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Teekond ise ei jää pooleli. [`files/playwright/test-native-login.js`](./files/playwright/test-native-login.js) ajab mõlemad isikud läbi Funkwhaleoma kett: `/login`, Keycloak edasi-tagasi reis, kui proxy väravad seda teed, siis Funkwhaleoma sisselogimisvorm, autenditud pinna kinnitus ja sisselogimine tagasi anonüümsesse riiki. See jäetakse vahele, kui `services.ldap.enabled` on vale, sest ükski isik ei oma Funkwhale selle variandi konto. Theo `guest` Isiksus ja põhiväited töötavad tingimusteta."

