# libretranslate
msgid "The orchestrator and the push entry workflow (`entry-push-latest.yml`) cancel in-progress runs on every ref except `main`, which no automatic trigger cancels. A `pull_request_target` run inherits `refs/heads/main` as its ref, so the orchestrator does not cancel there either; per-PR supersession is handled by the entry workflow's own `pr-ci-*` group. See [configuration.md](../../tools/github/actions/configuration.md)."
msgstr "Orkestraator ja push entry töövoog (`entry-push-latest.yml`) Tühista pooleliolevad käigud igal refil, välja arvatud `main`, mida automaatne päästik ei tühista. A `pull_request_target` pärib `refs/heads/main` kui oma ref, nii et orkestraator ei tühista ka seal; per-PR supersessioon tegeleb kirje töövoo enda `pr-ci-*` grupi. Vaata [configuration.md](../../tools/github/actions/configuration.md)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The orchestrator runs the following stages in order:"
msgstr "Orkestreerija läbib järgmised etapid järjekorras:"

# libretranslate
