# libretranslate
msgid "The persona flags are declared in [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). `administrator` is blocked only in the `sso: false` variants: as described above, Postmarks' sole native credential is the single shared `ADMIN_KEY` password form, which is not the Keycloak administrator secret the persona types, so without the trusted-header bridge there is no admin login to drive. `biber` is blocked in every variant — the oauth2-proxy admits only the application's administrator RBAC group and the bridge re-checks `X-Forwarded-Groups`, so `biber` is denied before Postmarks is reached, and with SSO off the only credential left belongs to no user account."
msgstr "Isikulipud deklareeritakse [templates/playwright.env.j2](./templates/playwright.env.j2). `administrator` on blokeeritud ainult `sso: false` variandid: nagu eespool kirjeldatud, PostmarksAinus emakeelne mandaat on üks jagatud `ADMIN_KEY` salasõna vorm, mis ei ole Keycloak administraator saladus persona tüübid, nii et ilma usaldusväärse päise sillata ei ole administraatori sisselogimist sõita. `biber` on blokeeritud igas variandis - oauth2-proxy võtab vastu ainult rakenduse administraatori RBAC grupi ja silla uuesti kontrollimise `X-Forwarded-Groups`, nii `biber` varem eitatakse Postmarks on saavutatud ja kui SSO on välja lülitatud, ei kuulu ainus mandaat vasakule kasutajakontole."

# libretranslate
msgid "The persona flags are declared in `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__. ``administrator`` is blocked only in the ``sso: false`` variants: as described above, Postmarks’ sole native credential is the single shared ``ADMIN_KEY`` password form, which is not the Keycloak administrator secret the persona types, so without the trusted-header bridge there is no admin login to drive. ``biber`` is blocked in every variant — the oauth2-proxy admits only the application’s administrator RBAC group and the bridge re-checks ``X-Forwarded-Groups``, so ``biber`` is denied before Postmarks is reached, and with SSO off the only credential left belongs to no user account."
msgstr "Isikulipud deklareeritakse `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__. ``administrator`` on blokeeritud ainult ``sso: false`` variandid: nagu eespool kirjeldatud, Postmarks’Ainus emakeelne mandaat on üks jagatud ``ADMIN_KEY`` salasõna vorm, mis ei ole Keycloak administraator saladus persona tüübid, nii et ilma usaldusväärse päise sillata ei ole administraatori sisselogimist sõita. ``biber`` on blokeeritud igas variandis - oauth2-proxy võtab vastu ainult rakenduse administraatori RBAC rühma ja sild kontrollib uuesti ``X-Forwarded-Groups``, nii ``biber`` varem eitatakse Postmarks on saavutatud ja kui SSO on välja lülitatud, ei kuulu ainus mandaat vasakule kasutajakontole."

# libretranslate
msgid "The persona scenarios MUST drive the journey from [Three personas, fixed flow](#three-personas-fixed-flow-) end to end. Per-service contract tests MUST exercise the [per-service assertion catalogue](#per-service-assertion-catalogue-) entry that matches their gated service. The [test_no_stub_tests.py](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/test_no_stub_tests.py) lint hard-fails the build when a stub is detected, so the rule is enforced automatically."
msgstr "Persona stsenaariumid peavad juhtima teekonda [Kolm isikut, fikseeritud vooluhulk](#three-personas-fixed-flow-) lõpuni. Teenuslepingu testid PEVAD teostama [teenusepõhiste väidete kataloog](#per-service-assertion-catalogue-) Sissepääs, mis sobib nende suletud teenusega. Theo [test_no_stub_tests.py](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/web-app/playwright/test_no_stub_tests.py) Lint raske-fails ehitatakse, kui stub tuvastatakse, nii et reegel jõustatakse automaatselt."

# libretranslate
msgid "The pin lives in ``[project.optional-dependencies].dev`` (one SPOT, Dependabot keeps it current). Host venvs, the lint container and CI all read that same pin, so a rule that is preview-gated in one release and stable in the next (e.g. ISC004, or S310 firing on ``urllib.request.Request``) cannot disagree across environments."
msgstr "Nõel elab ``[project.optional-dependencies].dev`` (One SPOT, Dependabot hoiab selle praegusena). Host venvs, lint konteiner ja CI kõik lugeda, et sama pin, nii et reegel, mis on eelvaade-gated ühes väljalase ja stabiilne järgmisel (nt ISC004, või S310 tulistan ``urllib.request.Request``) Ei saa olla erimeelsusi erinevates keskkondades."

