msgstr "Juurte kaardistamine, iga skalaar kui ``str``."

# libretranslate
msgid "The roundtrip is a gate, not a debugger: when a step goes red it stops and leaves the evidence in place. Do NOT just re-run the roundtrip; drop into the matching focused loop."
msgstr "Edasi-tagasi reis on värav, mitte silur: kui samm läheb punaseks, siis see peatub ja jätab asitõendid paika. ÄRGE käivitage lihtsalt edasi-tagasi reis; hüpake sobivasse fokuseeritud silmusesse."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The router runs init, then deploy. Init materialises the inventory under `${INFINITO_INVENTORY_DIR}` (resolved by `make dotenv` via [resolve.sh](../../../scripts/inventory/resolve.sh); see [variables.md](../environment/variables.md))."
msgstr "Ruuter käivitab init ja siis käivitab. Init realiseerib `${INFINITO_INVENTORY_DIR}` (lahendatud `make dotenv` viadu [resolve.sh](../../../scripts/inventory/resolve.sh); [variables.md](../environment/variables.md))."

msgid "The router sits inside the gateway. No consumer learns a second endpoint."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "The row has to run in the guide's own mode. The replay is a second deploy on the same runner, so hanging it on a swarm row would ask that runner to bring a compose stack up beside a swarm one. Only rows in that mode count as deployed here either, so the variant search cannot settle on one that this sweep runs in swarm alone."
msgstr "Rida peab töötama juhi enda režiimis. Kordusmäng on teine kasutuselevõtt samal jooksjal, nii et selle riputamine parvereale paluks jooksjal tuua komponeeritud virna parve kõrvale. Ainult selles režiimis olevad read loetakse ka siin kasutatavaks, nii et variandi otsing ei saa asuda ühele, mida see pühkimine töötab üksinda."

# libretranslate
msgid "The row then draws from that intersection instead of the run's whole pool, and so does every row whose variant deploys that role, as the deploy planner resolves it. A role and a run that permit nothing in common abort the matrix rather than dropping the row."
msgstr "Seejärel tõmbab rida sellest ristmikust kogu jooksu basseini asemel ja nii ka iga rida, mille variant kasutab seda rolli, kuna kasutuselevõtu planeerija lahendab selle. Roll ja jooks, mis ei luba midagi ühist, katkestab maatriksi, selle asemel, et rida kukutada."

# libretranslate
msgid "The rows the source run proved, as ``role#variant``, axes dropped."
msgstr "Reasid, mida allikas jooksis, tõestasid ``role#variant``, kirved langesid."

# libretranslate
msgid "The run is marked failed. GitHub notifies repository admins. No PR is created with a wrong identity."
msgstr "Jooks on märgitud nurjunuks. GitHub teavitab hoidla haldajaid. Ükski PR ei ole loodud vale identiteediga."

# libretranslate
msgid "The run leaves the cluster up (`INFINITO_KEEP_SWARM_NODES=true`). You MUST reproduce the failure on it via `make swarm-exec` / `make swarm-shell`, then release it with `make swarm-down`."
msgstr "Jooks jätab klastri üles (`INFINITO_KEEP_SWARM_NODES=true`). Te peate selle vea reprodutseerima `make swarm-exec` / `make swarm-shell`, siis vabastage see `make swarm-down`."

msgid "The run this builds differs from a retrigger: a retrigger replays what a run already judged, this one asks about rows nobody has judged yet or whose verdict is still disputed. It therefore states its axes instead of carrying them over."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "The run's 256-job cap is the second ceiling. `slots` counts every non-deploy job the orchestrator chain spawns, subtracts the worst `entry-*.yml` overhead, and what remains is `available` — the rows one sweep may deploy across all its chunks. Rows beyond that roll into the next sweep, which starts reading the regular line at an offset (`cli.meta.ci.chunks`), so consecutive sweeps walk the whole list instead of re-testing the same head forever."
msgstr "Jookseb 256- Töökork on teine lagi. `slots` Loendab iga töö, mida orkestrite kett kudeb, lahutab halvima `entry-*.yml` pea kohal ja see, mis jääb `available` - read, mida üks pühkimine võib kasutada kõigis selle osades. Selle rulli taga asuvad read järgmisesse pühkimisse, mis hakkab lugema tavalist joont nihkega (`cli.meta.ci.chunks`), nii et järjestikused pühkimised käivad kogu nimekirja, selle asemel, et sama pead uuesti katsetada."

# libretranslate
msgid "The runnable journey lives in ``files/playwright/test-login-biber.js``, which first grants biber the KIX user group over the Keycloak Admin API and then drives ``runKixLoginLogoutFlow`` through both stages to the universal logout. The path back to the generic persona is a KIX build that accepts the proxy’s trusted headers instead of demanding its own login."
msgstr "Jooksev teekond elab ``files/playwright/test-login-biber.js``, millega antakse kõigepealt luba KIX kasutajarühm Keycloak Admin API ja siis sõidab ``runKixLoginLogoutFlow`` Mõlemal etapil kuni universaalse väljanägemiseni. Tagasitee üldise isiku juurde on a KIX ehitada, mis aktsepteerib proxy usaldusväärseid päiseid, selle asemel, et nõuda oma sisselogimist."

# libretranslate
msgid "The runnable journey lives in `files/playwright/test-login-biber.js`, which first grants biber the KIX user group over the Keycloak Admin API and then drives `runKixLoginLogoutFlow` through both stages to the universal logout. The path back to the generic persona is a KIX build that accepts the proxy's trusted headers instead of demanding its own login."
msgstr "Jooksev teekond elab `files/playwright/test-login-biber.js`, millega antakse kõigepealt luba KIX kasutajarühm Keycloak Admin API ja siis sõidab `runKixLoginLogoutFlow` Mõlemal etapil kuni universaalse väljanägemiseni. Tagasitee üldise isiku juurde on a KIX ehitada, mis aktsepteerib puhverserveri usaldusväärseid päiseid, selle asemel, et nõuda oma sisselogimist."

# libretranslate
msgid "The runner is intentionally test-agnostic at runtime: it executes only tests provided by application roles."
msgstr "Jooksja on tahtlikult test-agnostiline jooksmise ajal: ta teostab ainult teste, mida pakuvad rakenduse rollid."

# libretranslate
msgid "The runner keeps Playwright traces, screenshots, and videos for every test only when the resolved environment variable `INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP` evaluates to `true` (case-insensitive). Any other value, including unset or empty, keeps artefacts only when a test fails."
msgstr "Jooksja säilitab Playwrighti jälgi, ekraanipilte ja videoid iga testi jaoks ainult siis, kui lahendatud keskkonnamuutuja `INFINITO_PLAYWRIGHT_KEEP` hindab `true` (juhtumitundlik). Mis tahes muu väärtus, sealhulgas väljalülitatud või tühi, säilitab esemeid ainult siis, kui test ebaõnnestub."

