# libretranslate
msgid "The section titles below are the classification vocabulary itself, and each role that ships a `meta/mcp.yml` is filed under the value that file declares. [test_mcp_audit_classification.py](../../tests/lint/repository/documentation/test_mcp_audit_classification.py) holds the two apart from drifting: it was written first and immediately named twenty-four roles whose audit entry contradicted their own metadata, nine of them shipping an adapter while the audit still called them untried candidates."
msgstr "Allpool olevad jaotise pealkirjad on klassifikatsiooni sõnavara ise ja iga roll, mis saadab `meta/mcp.yml` on esitatud väärtuse all, mida fail deklareerib. [test_mcp_audit_classification.py](../../tests/lint/repository/documentation/test_mcp_audit_classification.py) Need kaks on peale triivimise: see kirjutati esimesena ja kohe nimetati kakskümmend neli rolli, mille auditi sissekanne oli vastuolus nende enda metaandmetega, üheksa neist saatis adapteri, samas kui audit nimetas neid veel katsetamata kandidaatideks."

