# libretranslate
msgid "The single `make compose-deploy` target resolves one or more bundles into the role groups declared under `all.children` and feeds them into the standard local deploy flow when `bundles=<csv>` is set. The resolver is [`utils.inventory.bundle_apps`](../../utils/inventory/bundle_apps.py); it deduplicates across bundles and preserves declaration order."
msgstr "Üksik `make compose-deploy` sihtmärk lahendab ühe või mitu kimpu rolligruppidesse, mis on deklareeritud `all.children` ja toidab neid standardsesse kohalikku sissevoolu, kui `bundles=<csv>` on paigas. Lahendaja [`utils.inventory.bundle_apps`](../../utils/inventory/bundle_apps.py); see dedutseerib kimbud ja säilitab deklareerimise korra."

