# libretranslate
msgid "These assets are meant to support confidence, not ceremony. They help the project validate real-world behavior across local development, CI environments, and deployment-oriented smoke tests. The emphasis is on practical feedback: when something breaks, the surrounding test tooling should make the failure easier to understand, easier to reproduce, and easier to clean up. 🚀"
msgstr "Need varad on mõeldud usalduse, mitte tseremoonia toetamiseks. Need aitavad projektil valideerida reaalset käitumist kohalikus arengus, CI keskkondades ja kasutuselevõtule orienteeritud suitsutestides. Rõhuasetus on praktilisel tagasisidel: kui midagi puruneb, peaks ümbritsev testimisvahend muutma vea kergemini mõistetavaks, kergemini reprodutseeritavaks ja kergemini puhastatavaks. 🚀"

