# libretranslate
msgid "They should be listed as Idle in `github.com/<owner>/infinito-nexus/settings/actions/runners`."
msgstr "Need tuleks loetleda jõudeolekus `github.com/<owner>/infinito-nexus/settings/actions/runners`."

# libretranslate
msgid "They travel as `INFINITO_API_OPENAI_KEY`, `INFINITO_API_ANTHROPIC_KEY` and `INFINITO_API_OPENROUTER_KEY` through the workflow `env:` block, the passthrough allowlist in [passthrough.py](../../../../../utils/env/handlers/passthrough.py), the `infinito` service environment in [compose.yml](../../../../../compose.yml), and land in `API.<provider>.api_key` in the development inventory, whose path is the SPOT behind `INFINITO_INVENTORY_VARS_FILE`. Skipping the compose forwarding makes them resolve to empty inside the container without any error."
msgstr "Reisivad `INFINITO_API_OPENAI_KEY`, `INFINITO_API_ANTHROPIC_KEY` ja `INFINITO_API_OPENROUTER_KEY` töövoo kaudu `env:` plokk, läbimise lubajate nimekiri [passthrough.py](../../../../../utils/env/handlers/passthrough.py), `infinito` teeninduskeskkond [compose.yml](../../../../../compose.yml), ja maanduda `API.<provider>.api_key` arenguinventuuris, mille tee on SPOT taga `INFINITO_INVENTORY_VARS_FILE`. Komponendi edastamise vahelejätmine paneb nad otsustama tühjendada konteineri sees ilma vigadeta."

# libretranslate
msgid "Thin orchestrator that defines `EnvBuilder`, `BuildContext`, and `build_env()`. Walks the handler registry."
msgstr "Õhuke orkestraator, mis määratleb `EnvBuilder`, `BuildContext`, ja `build_env()`. Käitleja registris."

# libretranslate
msgid "Thin orchestrator: each variable's mapping/computation lives in its own module under :mod:`utils.env.handlers`. ``build_env`` walks the ``ORDERED_HANDLERS`` registry, letting each handler read/write through an :class:`EnvBuilder`."
msgstr "Õhuke orkestraator: iga muutuja kaardistamine / arvutamine elab oma mooduli all :mod:`utils.env.handlers`. ``build_env`` kõnnib ``ORDERED_HANDLERS`` Registreerimine, mis võimaldab igal käitlejal lugeda/kirjutada :class:`EnvBuilder`."

# libretranslate
msgid "Thin wrapper around the `image` lookup (the SPOT for resolving the ``<registry>/<image>:<version>`` reference). ``container_image`` only adds the ``image: \"...\"`` compose-line wrapping so templates can drop it in as a standalone statement:"
msgstr "Õhuke ümbris `image` otsing (KOHT probleemi lahendamiseks ``<registry>/<image>:<version>`` viide). ``container_image`` lisab ``image: \"...\"`` komponeeritud rea mähkimine, nii et mallid saaksid selle eraldiseisva lausena sisse lülitada:"

