# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys a central recursive/forwarding DNSSEC resolver (Unbound) in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It runs as a trivial single-service stack with a static IP on its own network, so consumer stacks can point their ``dns:`` at it instead of embedding their own resolver."
msgstr "See Ansible funktsioon kasutab keskset rekursiivset/edastavat DNSSEC lahendajat (Unbound) Dockeri konteineris Docker ComposeSee töötab triviaalse ühe teenuse pinuna, millel on oma võrgus staatiline IP, nii et tarbijate korstnad saavad oma sihtida ``dns:`` Selle asemel, et seda ise lahendada."

