# libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the management and balancing of Btrfs file systems. It clones the latest version of the [auto-btrfs-balancer](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/auto-btrfs-balancer.git) repository and configures a systemd service and timer to run the balancing script automatically."
msgstr "See roll automatiseerib Btrfsi failisüsteemide haldamist ja tasakaalustamist. See kloonib kõige uuemat versiooni [automaatne tasakaalustaja](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/auto-btrfs-balancer.git) hoidla ja konfigureerib süsteemne teenus ja taimer käivitada tasakaalustamise skripti automaatselt."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the management and balancing of Btrfs file systems. It clones the latest version of the `auto-btrfs-balancer <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/auto-btrfs-balancer.git>`__ repository and configures a systemd service and timer to run the balancing script automatically."
msgstr "See roll automatiseerib Btrfsi failisüsteemide haldamist ja tasakaalustamist. See kloonib kõige uuemat versiooni `auto-btrfs-balancer <https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/auto-btrfs-balancer.git>`__ hoidla ja konfigureerib süsteemne teenus ja taimer käivitada tasakaalustamise skripti automaatselt."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the process of setting up and running the Infinito.Nexus presentation in a Docker container, ensuring a reproducible and isolated environment for displaying the content."
msgstr "See roll automatiseerib süsteemi loomise ja toimimise protsessi. Infinito.Nexus esitus Dockeri konteineris, mis tagab sisu kuvamiseks reprodutseeritava ja isoleeritud keskkonna."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the removal of orphaned Docker volumes that consume unnecessary disk space. It is especially useful in backup, CI/CD, or maintenance routines."
msgstr "See roll automatiseerib orvuks jäänud Dockeri mahtude eemaldamise, mis tarbivad tarbetut kettaruumi. See on eriti kasulik varukoopiate, CI / CD või hooldusrutiinide puhul."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the restart process for Docker Compose instances within a specified directory. It deploys a Python script that checks for the presence of compose.yml files and restarts the associated services. A hard restart is applied for certain directories if needed."
msgstr "See funktsioon automatiseerib taaskäivitamise protsessi Docker Compose määratud kataloogi eksemplarid. See kasutab Pythoni skripti, mis kontrollib compose.yml failide ja seotud teenuste taaskäivitamine. Vajadusel rakendatakse teatud kataloogidele kõva taaskäivitamist."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the retrieval of [Let's Encrypt](https://letsencrypt.org/) SSL/TLS certificates using [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/) for domains served via NGINX. It supports both single-domain and wildcard certificates, and can use either the DNS or webroot ACME challenge methods."
msgstr "See roll automatiseerib [Krüpteerime](https://letsencrypt.org/) SSL/TLS sertifikaadid [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/) domeenid, mida teenindatakse NGINXi kaudu. See toetab nii ühe domeeni kui ka metakaardi sertifikaate ning võib kasutada kas DNS-i või veebiroot ACME väljakutse meetodeid."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the retrieval of `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ SSL/TLS certificates using `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__ for domains served via NGINX. It supports both single-domain and wildcard certificates, and can use either the DNS or webroot ACME challenge methods."
msgstr "See roll automatiseerib `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ SSL/TLS sertifikaadid `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__ domeenid, mida teenindatakse NGINXi kaudu. See toetab nii ühe domeeni kui ka metakaardi sertifikaate ning võib kasutada kas DNS-i või veebiroot ACME väljakutse meetodeid."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the setup of an automatic [Let's Encrypt](https://letsencrypt.org/) certificate renewal system for NGINX using [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/). It ensures that SSL/TLS certificates are renewed seamlessly in the background and that NGINX reloads automatically after successful renewals."
msgstr "See funktsioon automatiseerib automaatse seadistamise [Krüpteerime](https://letsencrypt.org/) NGINXi kasutav sertifikaadi uuendamise süsteem [Certbot](https://certbot.eff.org/). See tagab, et SSL/TLS sertifikaadid uuendatakse taustal sujuvalt ja NGINX laaditakse pärast edukaid uuendamisi automaatselt uuesti."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role automates the setup of an automatic `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ certificate renewal system for NGINX using `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__. It ensures that SSL/TLS certificates are renewed seamlessly in the background and that NGINX reloads automatically after successful renewals."
msgstr "See funktsioon automatiseerib automaatse seadistamise `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__ NGINXi kasutav sertifikaadi uuendamise süsteem `Certbot <https://certbot.eff.org/>`__. See tagab, et SSL/TLS sertifikaadid uuendatakse taustal sujuvalt ja NGINX laaditakse pärast edukaid uuendamisi automaatselt uuesti."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role bakes the upstream release artefact into a small ``nginx:alpine`` image and supports **multiple walls per deployment**: every entry under ```meta/services.yml.fediwall.walls`` <meta/services.yml>`__ materializes as its own path under ``https://fediwall.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/<slug>/`` with its own baked-in ``wall-config.json``. The root ``/`` shows a link list of all configured walls."
msgstr "See roll küpsetab ülesvoolu vabastava artefakti väikeseks ``nginx:alpine`` pilt ja toed **mitu seina kasutamise kohta**: iga sissekanne ```meta/services.yml.fediwall.walls`` <meta/services.yml>`__ materializes as its own path under ``https://fediwall.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/<slug>/`` with its own baked-in ``wall-config.json``. The root ``/`` näitab kõigi seadistatud seinte linkide nimekirja."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role bakes the upstream release artefact into a small `nginx:alpine` image and supports **multiple walls per deployment**: every entry under [`meta/services.yml.fediwall.walls`](meta/services.yml) materializes as its own path under `https://fediwall.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/<slug>/` with its own baked-in `wall-config.json`. The root `/` shows a link list of all configured walls."
msgstr "See roll küpsetab ülesvoolu vabastava artefakti väikeseks `nginx:alpine` pilt ja toed **mitu seina kasutamise kohta**: iga sissekanne [`meta/services.yml.fediwall.walls`](meta/services.yml) materialiseerub omaenese teena `https://fediwall.<DOMAIN_PRIMARY>/<slug>/` oma küpsetatud `wall-config.json`. Juur `/` näitab kõigi seadistatud seinte linkide nimekirja."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role bootstraps **per-domain NGINX configuration**: it requests TLS certificates, applies global modifiers, deploys a ready-made vHost file, and can optionally lock down access via OAuth2."
msgstr "See roll bootstraps **domeenipõhine NGINX konfiguratsioon**: ta taotleb TLS-sertifikaate, rakendab globaalseid modifikaatoreid, käivitab valmis vHost-faili ja võib valikuliselt lukustada juurdepääsu OAuthi kaudu2."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role bootstraps and manages a Docker Swarm cluster across the hosts in the Ansible group ``svc-swarm-node``. The manager is the single host in ``svc-swarm-manager``; every other group member joins as a worker. Membership is expressed via group membership only, never via duplicated lists in ``group_vars``. Inventory node labels are pushed to the cluster after the join phase."
msgstr "See roll käivitab ja haldab a Docker Swarm klaster üle Ansible grupi peremeeste ``svc-swarm-node``. Administraator on ainus võõrustaja ``svc-swarm-manager``; Kõik teised rühmaliikmed liituvad töötajana. Liikmelisust väljendatakse ainult grupi liikmelisuse kaudu, mitte kunagi topeltnimekirjade kaudu. ``group_vars``. Inventuuri sõlmede sildid lükatakse klastrisse pärast liitumisfaasi."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role bootstraps and manages a Docker Swarm cluster across the hosts in the Ansible group `svc-swarm-node`. The manager is the single host in `svc-swarm-manager`; every other group member joins as a worker. Membership is expressed via group membership only, never via duplicated lists in `group_vars`. Inventory node labels are pushed to the cluster after the join phase."
msgstr "See roll käivitab ja haldab a Docker Swarm klaster üle Ansible grupi peremeeste `svc-swarm-node`. Administraator on ainus võõrustaja `svc-swarm-manager`; Kõik teised rühmaliikmed liituvad töötajana. Liikmelisust väljendatakse ainult grupi liikmelisuse kaudu, mitte kunagi topeltnimekirjade kaudu. `group_vars`. Inventuuri sõlmede sildid lükatakse klastrisse pärast liitumisfaasi."

msgid "This role builds Postmarks from source into a custom image, wires it to the standard reverse proxy, and persists its SQLite data. Postmarks is single-user: there are no accounts, only \"the owner\". The upstream login is a single shared-secret password form that flips one session boolean (`req.session.loggedIn`)."
msgstr ""

msgid "This role builds Postmarks from source into a custom image, wires it to the standard reverse proxy, and persists its SQLite data. Postmarks is single-user: there are no accounts, only “the owner”. The upstream login is a single shared-secret password form that flips one session boolean (``req.session.loggedIn``)."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "This role builds and runs Bridgy Fed as a Docker container behind the project's front-proxy. An optional Firestore-emulator sidecar in Datastore mode provides the storage backend for non-production deployments."
msgstr "See roll loob ja töötab Bridgy Fed Dockeri konteinerina projekti esiproksi taga. Valikuline Firestore-emulaatori külgkorv Datastore'i režiimis pakub salvestuse taustaprogrammi mittetootmiseks."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role builds and runs Bridgy Fed as a Docker container behind the project’s front-proxy. An optional Firestore-emulator sidecar in Datastore mode provides the storage backend for non-production deployments."
msgstr "See roll loob ja töötab Bridgy Fed Dockeri konteiner projekti esiproksi taga. Valikuline Firestore-emulaatori külgkorv Datastore'i režiimis pakub salvestuse taustaprogrammi mittetootmiseks."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role builds its own Moodle image from upstream Moodle source on top of the official ``php:8.3-fpm`` base."
msgstr "See roll loob oma Moodle ülesvoolu Moodle allikale ``php:8.3-fpm`` baasi."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role builds its own Moodle image from upstream Moodle source on top of the official `php:8.3-fpm` base."
msgstr "See roll loob oma Moodle ülesvoolu Moodle allikale `php:8.3-fpm` baasi."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role builds on ``sys-stk-backend`` by adding a reverse-proxy frontend for HTTP access to your database service."
msgstr "See roll põhineb ``sys-stk-backend`` lisades oma andmebaasiteenusele HTTP-juurdepääsu jaoks pöördproksi kasutajaliidese."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role builds on `sys-stk-backend` by adding a reverse-proxy frontend for HTTP access to your database service."
msgstr "See roll põhineb `sys-stk-backend` lisades oma andmebaasiteenusele HTTP-juurdepääsu jaoks pöördproksi kasutajaliidese."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role builds the API image from ``files/Dockerfile``, bakes a snapshot of the deployed working tree into it and serves it at ``api.<domain>``. The container keeps one bare git repository with the branches and tags of core, of every public fork (discovered through the GitHub forks endpoint) and the snapshot as the ref ``deployed``, and fetches on a fixed interval. Every data endpoint takes a ``ref``: ``deployed``, a commit SHA, a branch or tag of core, or ``<owner>:<branch or tag>`` of a fork. Translations come from the ``core`` gettext catalogs under ``locale/``, which ``make i18n-extract`` and ``make i18n-translate`` maintain."
msgstr "See roll loob API pilt ``files/Dockerfile``, küpsetab selle sisse rakendatud tööpuu hetkepildi ja teenib seda ``api.<domain>``. Konteineris on üks paljas git hoidla koos harude ja siltidega südamikust, igast avalikust kahvlist. (avastas GitHubi kahvlite lõpp-punkt) ja hetkepilt kui kohtunik ``deployed``, ja tõmbab kindla ajavahemiku järel. Iga andmete lõpp-punkt võtab ``ref``: ``deployed``, sooritatud SHA, südamiku haru või märgis või ``<owner>:<branch or tag>`` kahvli. Tõlked pärinevad ``core`` gettext kataloogid all ``locale/``, mis ``make i18n-extract`` ja ``make i18n-translate`` säilitada."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role builds the API image from `files/Dockerfile`, bakes a snapshot of the deployed working tree into it and serves it at `api.<domain>`. The container keeps one bare git repository with the branches and tags of core, of every public fork (discovered through the GitHub forks endpoint) and the snapshot as the ref `deployed`, and fetches on a fixed interval. Every data endpoint takes a `ref`: `deployed`, a commit SHA, a branch or tag of core, or `<owner>:<branch or tag>` of a fork. Translations come from the `core` gettext catalogs under `locale/`, which `make i18n-extract` and `make i18n-translate` maintain."
msgstr "See roll loob API pilt `files/Dockerfile`, küpsetab selle sisse rakendatud tööpuu hetkepildi ja teenib seda `api.<domain>`. Konteineris on üks paljas git hoidla koos harude ja siltidega südamikust, igast avalikust kahvlist. (avastas GitHubi kahvlite lõpp-punkt) ja hetkepilt kui kohtunik `deployed`, ja tõmbab kindla ajavahemiku järel. Iga andmete lõpp-punkt võtab `ref`: `deployed`, sooritatud SHA, südamiku haru või märgis või `<owner>:<branch or tag>` kahvli. Tõlked pärinevad `core` gettext kataloogid all `locale/`, mis `make i18n-extract` ja `make i18n-translate` säilitada."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role builds upon core workstation and package management components to deliver a clean, editor-ready base for developers. It installs core tools and editors necessary to begin building, editing, and managing source code projects."
msgstr "See roll põhineb tööjaama ja paketihalduse põhikomponentidel, et pakkuda arendajatele puhast ja toimetajavalmis baasi. See installib põhilisi tööriistu ja redaktoreid, mis on vajalikud lähtekoodi projektide ehitamiseks, redigeerimiseks ja haldamiseks."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role can optionally bootstrap a Django superuser inside the Baserow container (useful for initial setup and automation)."
msgstr "See roll võib valikuliselt käivitada Django superkasutaja sees Baserow konteineri (Kasulik esmaseks seadistamiseks ja automatiseerimiseks)."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role cleans up failed Docker backups by configuring a systemd service and timer to execute the cleanup operations periodically."
msgstr "See roll puhastab ebaõnnestunud Dockeri varukoopiad, konfigureerides süsteemse teenuse ja taimeri puhastustoimingute perioodiliseks teostamiseks."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role cloudflare DNS bootstrap: parent host A/AAAA (and optional CAA), runs once per play."
msgstr "See roll cloudflare DNS bootstrap: vanemmasin A/ AAAA (ja vabatahtlik CAA), jookseb üks kord mängu kohta."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role combines Docker Compose with a central RDBMS role to automatically provision database containers with backup, user, and permission management."
msgstr "See roll ühendab Docker Compose keskse RDBMS-i rolliga, et pakkuda automaatselt andmebaasi konteinereid koos varundamise, kasutaja ja õiguste haldamisega."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role combines the central RDBMS role (``sys-svc-rdbms``) with Docker Compose to deliver a ready-to-use containerized database environment."
msgstr "See roll ühendab RDBMSi keskse rolli (``sys-svc-rdbms``) koos Docker Compose pakkuda kasutusvalmis konteineristatud andmebaasi keskkonda."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role combines the central RDBMS role (`sys-svc-rdbms`) with Docker Compose to deliver a ready-to-use containerized database environment."
msgstr "See roll ühendab RDBMSi keskse rolli (`sys-svc-rdbms`) koos Docker Compose pakkuda kasutusvalmis konteineristatud andmebaasi keskkonda."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role configures GNOME Shell extensions and installs the CLI GNOME Extension Manager for managing extensions."
msgstr "See roll seadistab GNOME Shell laiendab ja installib laienduste haldamiseks CLI GNOME laiendushalduri."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role configures Nginx to perform 301 redirects based on a list of source→target domain mappings."
msgstr "See roll seadistab Nginxi sooritama 301 suunab lähtekoodi→sihtdomeeni kaardistamise loendi alusel."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role configures a basic user environment (shell dotfiles and SSH authorized_keys) for a user selected via ``user_key``."
msgstr "See funktsioon seadistab põhilise kasutajakeskkonna (shell dotfiles ja SSH authorized_keys) kasutajale, kes on valitud ``user_key``."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role configures a basic user environment (shell dotfiles and SSH authorized_keys) for a user selected via `user_key`."
msgstr "See funktsioon seadistab põhilise kasutajakeskkonna (shell dotfiles ja SSH authorized_keys) kasutajale, kes on valitud `user_key`."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role configures a systemd timer to periodically start a corresponding service. It uses a Jinja2 template to create a timer unit file that specifies the scheduling parameters (such as OnCalendar and RandomizedDelaySec) and then restarts the timer service accordingly."
msgstr "See funktsioon seadistab süsteemse taimeri vastava teenuse perioodiliseks käivitamiseks. See kasutab Jinja2 mall taimerifaili loomiseks, mis määrab ajakava parameetrid (Näiteks OnCalendar ja RandomizedDelaySec) Seejärel taaskäivitub taimeriteenus vastavalt."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role configures an [NGINX](https://NGINX.org/) server to host a static HTML homepage securely over HTTPS. It automates domain configuration, SSL/TLS certificate retrieval using [Let's Encrypt](https://letsencrypt.org/), and ensures your site is ready for production with minimal setup."
msgstr "See roll seadistab [NGINX](https://NGINX.org/) server, mis majutab staatilise HTML-i kodulehe turvaliselt üle HTTPS-i. Automaatne domeenikonfiguratsioon, SSL/TLS sertifikaadi otsimine [Krüpteerime](https://letsencrypt.org/), ja tagab, et teie sait on valmis tootmiseks minimaalse seadistusega."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role configures an `NGINX <https://NGINX.org/>`__ server to host a static HTML homepage securely over HTTPS. It automates domain configuration, SSL/TLS certificate retrieval using `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__, and ensures your site is ready for production with minimal setup."
msgstr "See roll seadistab `NGINX <https://NGINX.org/>`__ server, mis majutab staatilise HTML-i kodulehe turvaliselt üle HTTPS-i. Automaatne domeenikonfiguratsioon, SSL/TLS sertifikaadi otsimine `Let’s Encrypt <https://letsencrypt.org/>`__, ja tagab, et teie sait on valmis tootmiseks minimaalse seadistusega."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role core role for Nginx HTML injection of Matomo, theming, iFrame and JS snippets based on application feature flags."
msgstr "See roll Nginxi HTML-i süstimisel Matomo, needing, iFrame ja JS-jupid, mis põhinevad rakenduse tunnuslippudel."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role create Cloudflare wildcard DNS records (*.parent) for parent hosts; no base or*.apex records."
msgstr "See funktsioon loob Cloudflare metakaardi DNS kirjed (*.vanem) algperemeesorganismide puhul; baas puudub või*.apexi andmed."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role creates a dedicated administrator user for local administrative tasks. The administrator account is configured to require a password when executing [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo), ensuring secure privilege escalation. For security reasons, it is recommended to use this dedicated administrator user instead of the default root account."
msgstr "See roll loob spetsiaalse administraatori kasutaja kohalike haldusülesannete täitmiseks. Administraatori konto on konfigureeritud nõudma käivitamisel parooli [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo), tagades privileegide turvalise eskalatsiooni. Turvalisuse huvides on soovitatav kasutada seda spetsiaalset administraatori kasutajat vaikimisi juurkonto asemel."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role creates a dedicated administrator user for local administrative tasks. The administrator account is configured to require a password when executing `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__, ensuring secure privilege escalation. For security reasons, it is recommended to use this dedicated administrator user instead of the default root account."
msgstr "See roll loob spetsiaalse administraatori kasutaja kohalike haldusülesannete täitmiseks. Administraatori konto on konfigureeritud nõudma käivitamisel parooli `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__, tagades privileegide turvalise eskalatsiooni. Turvalisuse huvides on soovitatav kasutada seda spetsiaalset administraatori kasutajat vaikimisi juurkonto asemel."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role creates a flexible directory layout for managing Docker Compose projects across environments. It ensures directories are initialized, optionally reset, and kept clean using internal flags like `MODE_RESET` or `MODE_CLEANUP`."
msgstr "See roll loob paindliku kataloogipaigutuse haldamiseks Docker Compose projektid erinevates keskkondades. See tagab, et kataloogid on initsialiseeritud, valikuliselt lähtestatud ja puhtad, kasutades sisemisi lippe nagu `MODE_RESET` või `MODE_CLEANUP`."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role creates a flexible directory layout for managing Docker Compose projects across environments. It ensures directories are initialized, optionally reset, and kept clean using internal flags like ``MODE_RESET`` or ``MODE_CLEANUP``."
msgstr "See roll loob paindliku kataloogipaigutuse haldamiseks Docker Compose projektid erinevates keskkondades. See tagab, et kataloogid on initsialiseeritud, valikuliselt lähtestatud ja puhtad, kasutades sisemisi lippe nagu ``MODE_RESET`` või ``MODE_CLEANUP``."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role creates the workstation user defined by *WORKSTATION_USER* and configures its basic environment. It integrates with the shared ``user`` role to deploy shell dotfiles and SSH ``authorized_keys``."
msgstr "See funktsioon loob tööjaama kasutaja, mille määrab *WORKSTATION_USER* See loob oma põhikeskkonna. See integreerub ühise ``user`` Shell-punktifailide ja SSH kasutuselevõtu roll ``authorized_keys``."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role creates the workstation user defined by *WORKSTATION_USER* and configures its basic environment. It integrates with the shared `user` role to deploy shell dotfiles and SSH `authorized_keys`."
msgstr "See funktsioon loob tööjaama kasutaja, mille määrab *WORKSTATION_USER* See loob oma põhikeskkonna. See integreerub ühise `user` Shell-punktifailide ja SSH kasutuselevõtu roll `authorized_keys`."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role creates the workstation user selected via WORKSTATION_USER and configures the user environment."
msgstr "See roll loob tööjaama kasutaja, kes on valitud WORKSTATION_USER ja konfigureerib kasutajakeskkonda."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for the same mechanism. Mattermost Team Edition ships no native OIDC provider, so the role piggybacks Keycloak onto the GitLab OAuth slot (`MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*` in `templates/env.j2`); the resulting entry point is `a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']`, relabelled \"SSO with Infinito.Nexus\" by `templates/javascript.js.j2`, which the shared helper's name-based login matcher does not recognise. Mattermost v11+ also serves a `/landing` interstitial to unauthenticated visitors that only clears once `localStorage.__landingPageSeen__` is seeded before navigation, and the shared helper has no init-script hook to do that."
msgstr "See roll deklareerib `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` ja `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` sisse `templates/playwright.env.j2` sama mehhanismi jaoks. Mattermost Team Edition laevad ei ole kohalikud OIDC pakkujad, nii et roll on piggybacks Keycloak peale GitLab OAuth (`MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*` sisse `templates/env.j2`); saadud sisenemispunkt on `a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']`, ümbermärgistatud \"SSO Infinito.Nexus\" poolt `templates/javascript.js.j2`, mida ühise abistaja nimepõhine sisselogija ei tunne ära. Mattermost v11+ teenib ka `/landing` interstitsiaalne autentimata külastajatele, kes puhastavad ainult üks kord `localStorage.__landingPageSeen__` on külvatud enne navigeerimist ja jagatud abistajal pole selleks init-skripti konksu."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for the same reason. `meta/services.yml` pins `sso.enabled: false` and `sso.shared: false`: MIG serves the pre-rendered Meta Infinite Graph over its own compose stack and has no login surface, no accounts, and no authenticated state at all. Consequently the env file renders no `ADMIN_USERNAME`, `ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `BIBER_USERNAME` or `BIBER_PASSWORD` for the shared helpers to read."
msgstr "See roll deklareerib `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` ja `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` sisse `templates/playwright.env.j2` samal põhjusel. `meta/services.yml` nõelad `sso.enabled: false` ja `sso.shared: false`: MIG teenindab eelrenderdatud Meta Infinite Graphi üle oma komponeeritud virna ja sellel ei ole sisselogimispinda, kontosid ega üldse autenditud olekut. Sellest tulenevalt muudab env-fail ei `ADMIN_USERNAME`, `ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `BIBER_USERNAME` või `BIBER_PASSWORD` Jagatud abilistele lugemiseks."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for two different reasons. The MinIO Console version pinned here never renders an SSO button — `/api/v1/login` answers `redirectRules: null` however the identity provider is registered server-side — so there is no in-page OIDC entry point for the shared helper to click. Biber is blocked because the only MinIO policy the role creates is the administrator RBAC group path (`MINIO_OIDC_POLICY_NAME` in `vars/main.yml`, attached in `tasks/02_ldap.yml`) and MinIO has no self-service signup, so biber maps to no policy and has no authenticated surface at either tier."
msgstr "See roll deklareerib `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` ja `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` sisse `templates/playwright.env.j2` kahel erineval põhjusel. Theo MinIO Siin kinnitatud konsooliversioon ei muuda kunagi SSO nuppu - `/api/v1/login` vastuseid `redirectRules: null` aga identiteedi pakkuja on registreeritud serveripoolne – seega puudub leheküljesisene OIDC sisendpunkt, millele jagatud abiline klõpsaks. Biber on blokeeritud, sest ainus MinIO poliitika, mille roll loob, on administraatori RBAC grupi tee (`MINIO_OIDC_POLICY_NAME` sisse `vars/main.yml`, lisatud `tasks/02_ldap.yml`) ja MinIO ei ole iseteenindusega registreerunud, nii et biber kaarte ei ole poliitika ja ei ole autenditud pind mõlemal tasandil."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` for two different reasons. The wiki's bureaucrat and sysop is a local account created by `maintenance/run.php createAndPromote` in `tasks/04_admin.yml` with `MEDIAWIKI_ADMINISTRATOR_PASSWORD` — the role-local `credentials.administrator_password`, not the Keycloak secret the persona helper carries in `ADMIN_PASSWORD`. `$wgPluggableAuth_EnableLocalLogin` is false, so no native form accepts that password anyway, and `$wgOpenIDConnect_UseEmailNameAsUserName` lands the Keycloak identity on a separate, e-mail-named wiki account that holds no sysop rights."
msgstr "See roll deklareerib `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` ja `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` sisse `templates/playwright.env.j2` kahel erineval põhjusel. Vikibürokraat ja sysop on kohalik konto, mille on loonud `maintenance/run.php createAndPromote` sisse `tasks/04_admin.yml` koos `MEDIAWIKI_ADMINISTRATOR_PASSWORD` — kohalik roll `credentials.administrator_password`, mitte Keycloak Salajane isik, keda abistaja kannab `ADMIN_PASSWORD`. `$wgPluggableAuth_EnableLocalLogin` on väär, nii et ükski emakeelne vorm ei aktsepteeri seda parooli niikuinii ja `$wgOpenIDConnect_UseEmailNameAsUserName` maandub Keycloak identiteet eraldi, e-posti nimega wiki kontol, millel ei ole sysop õigusi."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Keycloak provides SSO rather than consuming it: `meta/services.yml` carries no `sso` block (the `keycloak` service declares `provides: sso`) and pins `logout.enabled: false`, so the canonical URL has neither an oauth2-proxy gate nor an in-app OIDC login link for the shared persona helpers to click or log out of. The administrator persona is additionally out of reach because Keycloak's only admin surface is the master-realm console, which accepts the permanent super-admin account (`KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_USERNAME` / `KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_PASSWORD` in `vars/main.yml`, backed by the role-local `credentials.administrator_password`) and not the normal-realm `ADMIN_PASSWORD` the helper types."
msgstr "See roll deklareerib `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` ja `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` sisse `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Keycloak pakub SSO-d selle tarbimise asemel: `meta/services.yml` kannab `sso` blokeerida (need `keycloak` teenistus deklareerib `provides: sso`) nõeltega `logout.enabled: false`, nii et kanoonilisel URL-il ei ole oauth2- puhverserveri värav ega rakendusesisene OIDC sisselogimislink jagatud persona abistajatele klõpsamiseks või väljalogimiseks. Administraatori isik on samuti käeulatusest väljas, sest Keycloak's ainus admin pind on master-realm konsool, mis aktsepteerib püsivat super-admin kontot (`KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_USERNAME` / `KEYCLOAK_PERMANENT_ADMIN_PASSWORD` sisse `vars/main.yml`, mida toetab kohalik roll `credentials.administrator_password`) ja mitte normaalmaailma `ADMIN_PASSWORD` abilised."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Mailu's OIDC fork interposes its own `/sso/login` page that carries a local login form next to an `openid-connect/auth` link, while the authenticated Roundcube surface carries an `openid-connect/logout` link; the shared helper matches login controls by accessible name and cannot tell the two apart, so it clicks logout. The administrator persona is blocked for a second, independent reason: Mailu's admin surface is a separate Flask app mounted at `WEB_ADMIN=/admin` (`templates/env.j2`), not the `/webmail/` surface the OIDC callback lands on."
msgstr "See roll deklareerib `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` ja `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` sisse `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Mailu OIDC kahvel segab enda oma `/sso/login` lehekülg, mis kannab kohaliku sisselogimisvormi kõrval `openid-connect/auth` , samas kui autenditud ümarkuubi pind kannab `openid-connect/logout` link; jagatud abimees sobib sisselogimise juhtelementidega juurdepääsetava nimega ja ei suuda neid eristada, nii et see klõpsab väljalogimist. Administraatori isik on blokeeritud teisel sõltumatul põhjusel: Mailu administraatorpind on eraldi kolvirakendus, mis on paigaldatud `WEB_ADMIN=/admin` (`templates/env.j2`), mitte `/webmail/` OIDC tagasihelistamine maandub."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` and `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. `meta/services.yml` pins `sso.enabled: false` — Matomo holds no Keycloak client, so the OIDC round-trip the shared helper waits for never happens; the administrator signs in on Matomo's native `index.php?module=Login` form against the local superuser configured in `vars/main.yml`. Biber is blocked for a different reason: the role provisions exactly one Matomo account, that same superuser, and has no per-user provisioning, so biber has no Matomo identity at all."
msgstr "See roll deklareerib `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` ja `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` sisse `templates/playwright.env.j2`. `meta/services.yml` nõelad `sso.enabled: false` — Matomo ei pea Keycloak klient, nii et OIDC edasi-tagasi reis, mida jagatud abiline ootab, ei juhtu kunagi; administraator logib sisse Matomopärismaalane `index.php?module=Login` vorm konfigureeritud kohaliku superkasutaja vastu `vars/main.yml`. Biber on blokeeritud teisel põhjusel: roll sätestab täpselt ühe Matomo konto, et sama superuser, ja ei ole ühe kasutaja pakkumine, nii et biber ei ole Matomo üldse identiteeti."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Moodle's site administrator is created by `install_database.php` in `tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` and realigned on every pass, both from the `administrator` user, so the native form and the identity provider carry one secret. In the SSO variant `tasks/04_oidc.yml` sets `alternateloginurl` so `/login/index.php` bounces to the OIDC plugin and rewrites every `mdl_user` row to `auth='oidc'`, so no form accepts either secret; the SSO-off variants in `meta/variants.yml` have no OIDC chain to substitute. One env file is rendered per role, not per variant, so the flag has to hold for the worst case."
msgstr "See roll deklareerib `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` sisse `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Moodle'i saidi administraatori loob `install_database.php` sisse `tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` Ja iga kord, kui see on läbitud, nii `administrator` kasutaja, nii et emakeelne vorm ja identiteedi pakkuja kannavad ühte saladust. Laeva turvaülema variandis `tasks/04_oidc.yml` seab `alternateloginurl` nii `/login/index.php` põrkab OIDC pluginale ja kirjutab iga `mdl_user` sõudma `auth='oidc'`, nii et ükski vorm ei aktsepteeri kumbagi saladust; SSO-off variandid `meta/variants.yml` ei ole OIDC-ahelat asendamiseks. Üks env-fail renderdatakse rolli, mitte variandi kohta, nii et lipp peab hoidma halvimal juhul."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. KIX sits behind an oauth2-proxy whose `sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` in `meta/services.yml` admits only `roles/web-app-kix/administrator` and `roles/web-app-kix/user`; biber belongs to neither, so the proxy denies him before KIX renders anything. Past the proxy KIX is a two-stage login: the SPA still presents its own agent form at `/auth` that binds against LDAP, and the shared persona helper has no second stage after the Keycloak round-trip."
msgstr "See roll deklareerib `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` sisse `templates/playwright.env.j2`. KIX istub suu taga2- Vahendaja kelle `sso.oauth2.allowed_groups` sisse `meta/services.yml` tunnistab ainult `roles/web-app-kix/administrator` ja `roles/web-app-kix/user`; biber kuulub kummalegi, nii et volikiri eitab teda varem KIX muudab kõike. Vahendajast mööda KIX on kaheastmeline sisselogimine: SPA esitab endiselt oma agendivormi `/auth` mis seondub LDAP-i vastu ja jagatud persona assistendil ei ole pärast teist etappi Keycloak edasi-tagasi."

msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED`` and ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2`` for the same mechanism. Mattermost Team Edition ships no native OIDC provider, so the role piggybacks Keycloak onto the GitLab OAuth slot (``MM_GITLABSETTINGS_*`` in ``templates/env.j2``); the resulting entry point is ``a[href='/oauth/gitlab/login']``, relabelled “SSO with Infinito.Nexus” by ``templates/javascript.js.j2``, which the shared helper’s name-based login matcher does not recognise. Mattermost v11+ also serves a ``/landing`` interstitial to unauthenticated visitors that only clears once ``localStorage.__landingPageSeen__`` is seeded before navigation, and the shared helper has no init-script hook to do that."
msgstr ""

