# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` in ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. KIX sits behind an oauth2-proxy whose ``sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`` in ``meta/services.yml`` admits only ``roles/web-app-kix/administrator`` and ``roles/web-app-kix/user``; biber belongs to neither, so the proxy denies him before KIX renders anything. Past the proxy KIX is a two-stage login: the SPA still presents its own agent form at ``/auth`` that binds against LDAP, and the shared persona helper has no second stage after the Keycloak round-trip."
msgstr "See roll deklareerib ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED`` sisse ``templates/playwright.env.j2``. KIX istub suu taga2- Vahendaja kelle ``sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`` sisse ``meta/services.yml`` tunnistab ainult ``roles/web-app-kix/administrator`` ja ``roles/web-app-kix/user``; biber kuulub kummalegi, nii et volikiri eitab teda varem KIX muudab kõike. Vahendajast mööda KIX on kaheastmeline sisselogimine: SPA esitab endiselt oma agendivormi ``/auth`` mis seondub LDAP-i vastu ja jagatud persona assistendil ei ole pärast teist etappi Keycloak edasi-tagasi."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares no addons (it ships no ``meta/addons/`` directory). Mattermost **Team Edition** manages plugin install and enablement at runtime; there is no declarative per-plugin install path in this role. Plugins are operator-managed. The named volumes ``plugins`` and ``client-plugins`` declared in ``meta/volumes.yml`` are node-local derived copies that every replica extracts for itself from the image’s prepackaged bundles; an uploaded bundle persists in the file store, not in them. No addon bridges any in-repo service."
msgstr "See roll ei deklareeri lisandeid (laeval ``meta/addons/`` kataloogi). Mattermost. **Team Edition** haldab pluginate installimist ja lubamist tööajal. Selles rollis ei ole deklaratiivset plugina installimise asukohta. Pluginad on operaatori hallatavad. Nimetatud köited ``plugins`` ja ``client-plugins`` kuulutatud ``meta/volumes.yml`` Need on sõlm-kohalikud tuletatud koopiad, mida iga koopia ekstraktib enda jaoks pildi eelnevalt pakitud kimpudest; üleslaaditud kimp püsib failihoidlas, mitte nendes. Ükski lisand ei sildu ühegi repoteenusega."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares no addons (it ships no `meta/addons/` directory). Mattermost **Team Edition** manages plugin install and enablement at runtime; there is no declarative per-plugin install path in this role. Plugins are operator-managed. The named volumes `plugins` and `client-plugins` declared in `meta/volumes.yml` are node-local derived copies that every replica extracts for itself from the image's prepackaged bundles; an uploaded bundle persists in the file store, not in them. No addon bridges any in-repo service."
msgstr "See roll ei deklareeri lisandeid (laeval `meta/addons/` kataloogi). Mattermost. **Team Edition** haldab pluginate installimist ja lubamist tööajal. Selles rollis ei ole deklaratiivset plugina installimise asukohta. Pluginad on operaatori hallatavad. Nimetatud köited `plugins` ja `client-plugins` kuulutatud `meta/volumes.yml` Need on sõlm-kohalikud tuletatud koopiad, mida iga koopia ekstraktib endale pildi eelpakendatud kimpudest; üleslaaditud kimp püsib failihoidlas, mitte nendes. Ükski lisand ei sildu ühegi repoteenusega."

