# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys ejabberd on Docker Compose with the project's standard role-meta wiring. It binds ejabberd's `auth_method` to `svc-db-openldap` so XMPP clients authenticate against the project's central LDAP. The OIDC variant additionally loads `mod_oauth2_client` so a Keycloak-issued bearer token can be exchanged for an ejabberd session, but most XMPP clients still rely on SCRAM-SHA-256 over LDAP, which remains the interoperable default."
msgstr "See roll kasutab ejabberdi Docker Compose projekti standardse rolli-meta juhtmestikuga. See seob ejabberdi. `auth_method` kuni `svc-db-openldap` nii XMPP Kliendid autentivad projekti keskse LDAP-i vastu. OIDC variant lisakoormused `mod_oauth2_client` nii Keycloak-väljastatud kandja märgi saab vahetada ejabberd seansiks, kuid enamik XMPP Kliendid toetuvad endiselt SCRAM-SHA-le256 üle LDAP, mis jääb koostalitlusvõimeliseks vaikimisi."

