# libretranslate
msgid "This role provisions a complete Nextcloud deployment using Docker Compose. It automates the setup of the Nextcloud application along with its underlying MariaDB database and configures the system for secure public access via an NGINX reverse proxy. The deployment includes automated configuration merging into ``config.php``, health check routines, and integrated support for backup and recovery operations."
msgstr "See roll tagab täieliku Nextcloud kasutamine Docker ComposeSee automatiseerib süsteemi seadistamise Nextcloud rakendus koos alusvaraga MariaDB andmebaasi ja konfigureerib süsteemi turvaliseks avalikuks juurdepääsuks NGINX pöördproksi kaudu. Paigaldamine hõlmab automaatset konfigureerimist ``config.php``, tervisekontrolli rutiine ning integreeritud toetust varu- ja taastamistoimingutele."

# libretranslate
