# libretranslate
msgid "When ``svc-net-tor`` is deployed, the node’s ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY`` is the minted ``.onion`` address, so the whole stack (web vhosts, Keycloak SSO, LDAP, CA) resolves onion domains consistently. The Tor daemon runs as a host-network compose sidecar and maps one hidden service to the host OpenResty (``HiddenServicePort 80 -> 127.0.0.1:80``); per-app subdomains (``<app>.<node>.onion``) are routed by the ``Host`` header. TLS is off on the onion side (onion v3 already provides transport encryption + server authentication); apps still receive ``X-Forwarded-Proto: https`` because ``.onion`` is a browser Secure Context."
msgstr "Millal ``svc-net-tor`` käivitatakse, sõlm ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY`` vermitud ``.onion`` aadress, nii et kogu hunnik (veebivhostid, Keycloak SSO, LDAP, CA) lahendab sibula domeene järjekindlalt. Tor-deemon jookseb host-võrgu komponendina külgkorvi ja kaardistab hostile ühe varjatud teenuse OpenResty (``HiddenServicePort 80 -> 127.0.0.1:80``); rakenduse alamdomeenid (``<app>.<node>.onion``) suunatakse ``Host`` päis. TLS on välja lülitatud sibula poolel (sibulat3 juba pakub transpordi krüpteerimist + serveri autentimist); rakendused saavad endiselt ``X-Forwarded-Proto: https`` sest ``.onion`` on brauser Secure Context."

# libretranslate
msgid "When ``svc-net-tor`` is in the deploy, mint (or reuse) the node onion and set ``applications.svc-net-tor.services.tor.node`` in the host_vars."
msgstr "Millal ``svc-net-tor`` on kasutusel, piparmünt (taaskasutada) sõlme sibul ja ``applications.svc-net-tor.services.tor.node`` sisse host_vars."

# libretranslate
msgid "When ``tor_node`` is set (svc-net-tor deployed) and the URL's host is the ``primary_domain`` or a subdomain of it, swap that suffix for ``tor_node`` and force the ``http`` scheme (onion services are plaintext-only). Anything else — empty inputs, a host not under ``primary_domain``, an unparseable value — is returned unchanged, so the filter is a safe no-op on clearnet."
msgstr "Millal ``tor_node`` seatud (svc-net-tor saadeti) ja URL- i host on ``primary_domain`` või selle alamdomeeni, vaheta see järelliide ``tor_node`` ja sundida ``http`` skeemi (Sibulteenused on ainult lihttekstilised).Kõik muu - tühjad sisendid, masin, mis pole all ``primary_domain``, tasakaalustamatu väärtus – tagastatakse muutmata kujul, nii et filter on Clearneti turvaline no-op."

# libretranslate
msgid "When ``version`` is unset (no services value, no override), the lookup returns the bare ``<image>`` (unpinned) and emits a ``display.warning`` so the operator notices the unpinned reference without aborting the play."
msgstr "Millal ``version`` segane (puudub teenuse väärtus, puudub tühistamine), otsing tagastab palja ``<image>`` (painutamata) ja kiirgab ``display.warning`` nii et operaator märkab kinnitamata viidet ilma esitust katkestamata."

# libretranslate
msgid "When `cli create role` scaffolds a new role, it prompts for `--clients N` and calls `cli contributing network address suggest --clients N --count 1` to fill in `meta/server.yml.networks.local.subnet` automatically. The contributor MAY override the suggestion interactively. See [port.md](port.md) for the matching ports flow."
msgstr "Millal `cli create role` Tagajärjeks on uus roll, see nõuab `--clients N` kõnedega `cli contributing network address suggest --clients N --count 1` täita `meta/server.yml.networks.local.subnet` automaatselt. Kaastöötaja VÕIB ettepaneku interaktiivselt tühistada. Vaata [port.md](port.md) sobitamisportide voolu jaoks."

