# libretranslate
msgid "[ ] Credentials and secret URL components are absent from logs, generated non-secret configuration, API responses, task output, Playwright traces, and exception text. **Three of the six surfaces are held statically:** logs and task output by [test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py), which requires `no_log` or `mask_values` on any MCP task that both handles a secret and prints; Playwright traces by [test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py), which forbids a `playwright.env.j2` from rendering `mcp_credential`, a `credentials.mcp_*` secret or a `key_credential` URL component. Generated non-secret configuration needs a secret/non-secret classification of rendered files that does not exist yet; API responses and exception text are runtime observations for the deploy phase."
msgstr "[ ] Volikirjad ja salajased URL-i komponendid puuduvad logidest, genereeritud mittesalajane konfiguratsioon; API Vastused, ülesannete väljund, Playwrighti jäljed ja erandi tekst. **Kuuest pinnast kolm hoitakse staatiliselt:** logide ja ülesannete väljund [test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py), mis nõuab `no_log` või `mask_values` iga MCP ülesande kohta, mis käsitleb nii saladust kui ka trükiseid; Playwrighti jälgi [test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py), mis keelab `playwright.env.j2` renderdamisest `mcp_credential`, `credentials.mcp_*` saladust `key_credential` URL-i komponent. Geneeritud mittesalajane konfiguratsioon vajab renderdatud failide salajast/salajast klassifikatsiooni, mida veel ei ole; API vastused ja eranditekst on käivitamisfaasi käitusaja vaatlused."

