# libretranslate
msgid "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_ACCESS_KEY_ENCRYPTION` and the cookie hash/encryption secrets are generated once and persisted in the role's secret store (idempotent across redeploys)."
msgstr "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_ACCESS_KEY_ENCRYPTION` Küpsise räsi/krüptimise saladused genereeritakse üks kord ja püsivad rolli salapoes (ümberpaigutamine)."

# libretranslate
msgid "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_NAME`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_EMAIL` seed a break-glass local admin (dedicated `breakglass` login + dedicated email, no collision with the SSO/LDAP identities) in **every** variant; no setup wizard is presented on first load. Its form login is reachable only when LDAP is disabled (Semaphore forces LDAP-only form auth otherwise)."
msgstr "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_NAME`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_EMAIL` seeme klaasimurdmise kohalik admin (pühendunud `breakglass` sisselogimine + spetsiaalne e-post, ei ole kokkupõrget SSO/LDAP identiteetidega) sisse **iga** variant; esimesel koormusel seadistusnõustajat ei esitata. Selle vormi sisselogimine on võimalik ainult siis, kui LDAP on välja lülitatud (Semafori jõud ainult LDAP-ga moodustavad muul juhul auth'i)."

# libretranslate
msgid "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT=postgres` plus `SEMAPHORE_DB_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SEMAPHORE_DB` are wired; when `services.postgres.shared=true` the role consumes the central `svc-db-postgres` (no per-role engine), else `sys-svc-rdbms` templates a per-role Postgres."
msgstr "[ ] `SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT=postgres` pluss `SEMAPHORE_DB_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SEMAPHORE_DB` juhtmega; millal `services.postgres.shared=true` roll neelab keskse `svc-db-postgres` (ühe rolliga mootor puudub), muidu `sys-svc-rdbms` vormib rollijärgse postikulu."

# libretranslate
