msgstr "[`tasks/01_setup.yml`](./tasks/01_setup.yml) külvab ainult administraatori Magentoadministraatoritabel (`bin/magento setup:install --admin-user`, volitusi [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)); `biber` Taustaprogrammi jõuab ainult läbi oauth2- Proxy deklareeritud [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml). `services.sso.enabled: false` maatriksvariandid, mis puuduvad ja `biber` omamaist kontot ei ole, seega [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renderdab `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. `administrator` persona hoiab oma loomuliku sisselogimise `ADMIN_NATIVE_PASSWORD` ja töötab igas variandis."

# libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/05_administrator.yml`](./tasks/05_administrator.yml) creates the account with `tootctl accounts create` and never sets or captures a password, so `ADMIN_PASSWORD` — the Keycloak secret — cannot drive Mastodon's native `/auth/sign_in`; `biber` has no Mastodon account at all, since the OIDC sign-in ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)) is the only path that would create one. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants that path is removed, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The SeaweedFS companion scenario ([`files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js`](./files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js)) drives the same admin journey and skips on the same flag."
msgstr "[`tasks/05_administrator.yml`](./tasks/05_administrator.yml) loob konto `tootctl accounts create` Ärge kunagi määrake ega püüdke parooli, nii et `ADMIN_PASSWORD` - Keycloak saladus – ei saa juhtida Mastodonpärismaalane `/auth/sign_in`; `biber` pole Mastodon OIDC sisselogimisest alates ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)) See on ainus tee, mis selle loob. Sisse `services.sso.enabled: false` Maatriksi variandid, mille tee on eemaldatud, nii et [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renderdab `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` ja `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. SeaweedFS kaasstsenaarium ([`files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js`](./files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js)) Sõidab sama admin-reisi ja jätab sama lipu vahele."

# libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml`](tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml) runs after `update.php`. It includes the shared gateway consumer contract, then reads both globals back out of the running container with `maintenance/run.php getConfiguration --format=json` and asserts the provider, the base URL and the model, so an unconfigured surface cannot reach a green deploy."
msgstr "[`tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml`](tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml) jookseb `update.php`. See sisaldab jagatud värava tarbijalepingut, seejärel loeb mõlemad globaalsed välja jooksvast konteinerist koos `maintenance/run.php getConfiguration --format=json` ja kinnitab pakkuja, baas-URL-i ja mudeli, nii et konfigureerimata pind ei jõua rohelise kasutuselevõtuni."

# libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) creates a dedicated non-superuser owner (`mcp@<canonical-domain>`, unusable password) plus its own workspace, and binds the endpoint to that pair."
msgstr "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) loob spetsiaalse mittesuperkasutaja omaniku (`mcp@<canonical-domain>`, kasutuskõlbmatu parool) pluss oma tööruum ja seob lõpp-punkti selle paariga."

# libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) waits for the ExApp heartbeat, registers the deploy daemon and the ExApp (route `^/mcp`, verbs `POST,GET,DELETE`, access level `1`), enables the ExApp, mints an app password for the dedicated MCP account via `occ user:auth-tokens:add`, persists it through `sys-token-store` under `users['mcp-web-app-nextcloud'].tokens['web-app-nextcloud']`, and asserts that an authenticated `initialize` call answers `200`."
msgstr "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) ootab ExAppi südamelööke, registreerib kasutuselevõtu deemoni ja ExAppi (marsruudi `^/mcp`, tegusõnad `POST,GET,DELETE`, juurdepääsu tase `1`), lubab ExAppi, vermib spetsiaalse MCP konto jaoks rakenduse parooli `occ user:auth-tokens:add`, hoiab seda läbi `sys-token-store` altpoolt `users['mcp-web-app-nextcloud'].tokens['web-app-nextcloud']`, ja kinnitab, et autenditud `initialize` kõnevastused `200`."

# libretranslate
msgid "[`templates/config.exs.j2`](./templates/config.exs.j2) wires Keycloak as the only login provider this role configures, and [`tasks/main.yml`](./tasks/main.yml) creates no Mobilizon account; `MOBILIZON_INSTANCE_DISABLE_DATABASE_LOGIN` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)) additionally closes the database login whenever LDAP is on. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants neither persona has credentials, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "[`templates/config.exs.j2`](./templates/config.exs.j2) juhtmed Keycloak ainsa sisselogimisteenuse pakkujana on see roll konfigureeritud ja [`tasks/main.yml`](./tasks/main.yml) ei loo Mobilizon konto; `MOBILIZON_INSTANCE_DISABLE_DATABASE_LOGIN` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)) sulgeb andmebaasi sisselogimise iga kord, kui LDAP on sisse lülitatud. Sisse `services.sso.enabled: false` Maatriksvariandid kumbki isik ei ole volikirjad, nii et [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renderdab `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` ja `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. `guest` Isiksus ja põhiväited töötavad tingimusteta."

# libretranslate
msgid "[`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) seeds only the administrator into SuiteCRM (`SUITECRM_ADMIN_USERNAME` / `SUITECRM_ADMIN_PASSWORD`); `biber` reaches the app through SuiteCRM's own SAML login against Keycloak, where `SAML_AUTO_CREATE` mints the account on first assertion. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants there is no SAML entry point and `biber` has no native account, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` for the generic persona journeys (the LDAP spec still signs `biber` in from the directory). The `administrator` persona keeps its native login via `ADMIN_NATIVE_PASSWORD` and runs in every variant."
msgstr "[`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) külvab ainult administraatori SuiteCRM (`SUITECRM_ADMIN_USERNAME` / `SUITECRM_ADMIN_PASSWORD`); `biber` jõuab rakendusse SuiteCRMSAMLi enda sisselogimine Keycloak, kus `SAML_AUTO_CREATE` Rahastatakse konto esimesel väitel. Sisse `services.sso.enabled: false` Maatriksvariantidel puudub SAML-i sisenemispunkt ja `biber` omamaist kontot ei ole, seega [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renderdab `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` personaalreiside puhul (LDAP märgid `biber` kataloogist). `administrator` persona hoiab oma loomuliku sisselogimise `ADMIN_NATIVE_PASSWORD` ja töötab igas variandis."

# libretranslate
msgid "[`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` in every matrix variant, because the shared persona helper cannot drive this role's sign-in in any of them. Three independent reasons, each sufficient on its own:"
msgstr "[`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renderdab `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` ja `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` igas maatriksi variandis, sest jagatud persona abimees ei saa juhtida selle rolli sisselogimist üheski neist. Kolm sõltumatut põhjust, millest igaühest piisab eraldi:"

