msgstr "[x] Stack sisaldab Penpot **frontend** konteiner."

# libretranslate
msgid "[x] The stack is rendered with **one `docker stack` per role** (consistent with today's one-compose-project-per-role model). Granular `docker stack deploy / update / rm` operations per role MUST be possible. A single global stack across all Infinito services is explicitly rejected."
msgstr "[x] virn sulatatakse **üks `docker stack` rolli** (See on kooskõlas tänapäeva ühe komplekt-projekt-roll-mudeliga.). Granulaarne `docker stack deploy / update / rm` Igasugune tegevus peab olema võimalik. Kõigi Infinito teenuste ühtne ülemaailmne virna on selgesõnaliselt tagasi lükatud."

# libretranslate
msgid "[x] The stack reaches a steady running state in every variant, and `make quality` is green tree-wide. `make quality` (docs + autoformat + the four suites) passes end to end — `test-external`, `test-integration`, `test-lint` and `test-unit` all green. All three variants reach a steady running state with `failed=0`."
msgstr "[x] virna saavutab stabiilse tööoleku igas variandis ja `make quality` on terve roheline puu. `make quality` (Docs + autoformaat + neli sviiti) möödub lõpust lõpuni – `test-external`, `test-integration`, `test-lint` ja `test-unit` roheliseks. Kõik kolm varianti saavutavad stabiilse tööoleku `failed=0`."

# libretranslate
msgid "[x] The supported catalog adapters are documented and bounded so broad marketplaces do not produce unreviewable warning noise."
msgstr "[x] Toetatud kataloogiadapterid on dokumenteeritud ja piiratud, nii et laiad turud ei tekita ülevaatamatut hoiatusmüra."

# libretranslate
msgid "[x] The three baseline personas are covered per the [Playwright contract](../contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md): `guest` (never reaches an authenticated surface), `biber`, `administrator`, each in its own `test-*.js` module aggregated by `playwright.spec.js`, with SSO/LDAP steps guarded by `skipUnlessServiceEnabled`. `guest` runs live; `biber` and `administrator` are blocked with `PERSONA_*_BLOCKED` under the contract's documented escape, each carrying a `# nocheck: persona-block-rationale` naming the role property that forces it — biber holds no OpenBao RBAC group by design, and the shared persona helper cannot drive OpenBao's method-select + popup + `postMessage` login. The administrator's OIDC journey is asserted instead by `test-oidc-login.js`, and biber's denial by `test-ldap-login.js`."
msgstr "[x] Kolm põhilist isikut on kaetud iga [Playwrighti leping](../contributing/artefact/files/role/playwright.specs.js.md): `guest` (ei ulatu kunagi autenditud pinnani), `biber`, `administrator`, igaüks eraldi `test-*.js` moodul liidetuna `playwright.spec.js`, mille SSO/LDAP astmeid valvab `skipUnlessServiceEnabled`. `guest` jookseb otse; `biber` ja `administrator` blokeeritakse `PERSONA_*_BLOCKED` Lepingus dokumenteeritud põgenemise korral on igaühel kaasas `# nocheck: persona-block-rationale` Nimetage rolliomadus, mis seda sunnib - Biber ei hoia OpenBao RBAC grupp disaini järgi ja jagatud persona abimees ei saa sõita OpenBao's method- selection + popup + `postMessage` sisselogimine. Administraatori OIDC-reisi kinnitab selle asemel `test-oidc-login.js`, ja biber eitab `test-ldap-login.js`."

# libretranslate
msgid "[x] The user identifier is templated from `{{ OIDC.ATTRIBUTES.USERNAME }}`; the literal `preferred_username` does not appear in the role."
msgstr "[x] Kasutaja identifikaator on mallitud `{{ OIDC.ATTRIBUTES.USERNAME }}`; sõna otseses mõttes `preferred_username` ei esine rollis."

# libretranslate
msgid "[x] The vhost configures WebSocket upgrade so real-time collaboration (live cursors, comments) works (handled by the shared proxy template)."
msgstr "[x] Vhost konfigureerib WebSocketi uuendamist nii reaalajas koostööks (reaalajas kursorid, kommentaarid) töötab (mida käsitletakse jagatud puhverserveri malliga)."

