# libretranslate
msgid "`.env` (gitignored) is generated by `make dotenv`, which delegates to `python -m cli.meta.env`. It combines `default.env` with runtime-resolved values (selected distro, GHA/Act flags, df/meminfo-derived cache sizes, sha256 secrets, repository owner, ...). Each line in `.env` is preceded by its own comment, so the file is self-describing. Open it after `make dotenv` to inspect the effective value-set together with its documentation."
msgstr "`.env` (gitignored) genereeritakse `make dotenv`, mis delegeerib `python -m cli.meta.env`. See ühendab `default.env` käitusaja väärtustega (valitud distro, GHA/Act lipud, df/meminfost tuletatud vahemälu suurused, sha256 saladused, hoidla omanik, ...)Iga rida `.env` Sellele eelneb oma kommentaar, nii et fail kirjeldab ennast. Ava pärast seda `make dotenv` kontrollida tegelikku väärtuste kogumit koos dokumentatsiooniga."

# libretranslate
msgid "`.env` is consumed by bash `source` and docker-compose `--env-file`, neither of which round-trips multi-line values; the writer therefore rejects them. Other NIX_CONFIG settings (`accept-flake-config`, `experimental-features`, …) belong in `/etc/nix/nix.conf` (Dockerfile injects them inside the dev container; host operators set them once in `~/.config/nix/nix.conf`)."
msgstr "`.env` tarbitakse bashi `source` ja dokkerikompositsioon `--env-file`, millest kumbki ei lükka edasi-tagasi mitmerealisi väärtusi; seetõttu lükkab kirjanik need tagasi. Teised NIX_CONFIG seaded (`accept-flake-config`, `experimental-features`, ...) kuulu `/etc/nix/nix.conf` (Dockerfile süstib need dev konteinerisse; host operaatorid seavad need üks kord sisse `~/.config/nix/nix.conf`)."

# libretranslate
msgid "`.github/workflows/call-test-deploy.yml` runs the replay as the job's last step, after the row's own deploy and after the swarm teardown: the replay deploys the role a second time and needs the runner's ports. It calls `scripts/tests/deploy/distros.sh scripts/github/guide/one.sh` with `GUIDE_ROLE` set to the row's app and `GUIDE_MODE` to the mode the marker carries, which is independent of the deploy mode the rotation gave the row. A swarm row therefore still replays a `compose` guide."
msgstr "`.github/workflows/call-test-deploy.yml` käivitab korduse töö viimase sammuna pärast rea enda käivitamist ja pärast parve rebenemist: kordus kasutab rolli teist korda ja vajab jooksja porte. Kutsub `scripts/tests/deploy/distros.sh scripts/github/guide/one.sh` koos `GUIDE_ROLE` rea rakendusse ja `GUIDE_MODE` olekusse, mida marker kannab, mis ei sõltu käivitusrežiimist, mille pööramine rea andis. Sülemirida kordab seetõttu endiselt `compose` teejuht."

