# libretranslate
msgid "`INCLUDE_PATHS` — newline-separated workflow paths, the members of the concurrency group being backed up. Without it the helpers would also cancel runs the group never governed, such as the `cron-*` workflows that listen on `push`. Derive the list from the `concurrency:` blocks, not from what looks related: `entry-delete-branch.yml` keys its group on the *deleted* ref, so it is not a member of a push's group, and listing it would make a push to `main` cancel an unrelated branch cleanup. A value that lists no path at all aborts rather than silently matching nothing."
msgstr "`INCLUDE_PATHS` — uue liiniga eraldatud töövoo teed, mille puhul varundatakse vastavusrühma liikmeid. Ilma selleta tühistaksid abilised ka grupi, mida kunagi ei valitsetud, näiteks `cron-*` töövood, mis kuulavad `push`. Nimekirja tuletamine `concurrency:` blokid, mitte sellest, mis tundub seotud: `entry-delete-branch.yml` klahvid grupile *kustutatud* ref, nii et see ei ole push'i rühma liige ja selle loetlemine annaks tõuke `main` katkestada mitteseotud haru puhastamine. Väärtus, mis ei loetle ühtegi teed, katkestab selle asemel, et vaikselt mitte midagi sobitada."

