# libretranslate
msgid "``ansible`` (default) wraps `matrix-docker-ansible-deploy <https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy>`__ (MDAD). MDAD runs ~70 upstream sub-roles to deliver Synapse, Element, every supported bridge, Element Call, and Jitsi. Infinito.Nexus pins MDAD by commit, renders an MDAD inventory from ``services.matrix.*`` knobs, and disables MDAD’s bundled Traefik / Postgres / Redis so the central Infinito services back the stack."
msgstr "``ansible`` (vaikimisi) mähki `matrix-docker-ansible-deploy <https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy>`__ (MDAD)MDAD jookseb ~70 ülesvoolu alamrollid Synapse, Element, iga toetatud sild, Element Call ja Jitsi edastamiseks. Infinito.Nexus Tips MDAD sissekandega, renderdab MDAD inventuuri ``services.matrix.*`` nupud ja keelab MDAD komplekteeritud Traefik / Postgres / Redis Nii et keskne Infinito teenused tagasi virna."

