# libretranslate
msgid "``entries`` is a list of dotted-path facts about the file's content. Each entry carries the same ``mandatory`` and ``allowed`` semantics described above and adds a ``marker`` flag (default ``False``): ``marker: True`` declares the path as the type marker for the surrounding type entry. :func:`utils.roles.type.get_role_types` walks every ``marker: True`` entry; each marker that resolves to a non-empty value in the role's file adds the surrounding type to the role's type set. ``application_id`` for ``application`` and ``system_service_id`` for ``system-service`` are the canonical markers."
msgstr "``entries`` on loetelu punktiirjoone faktidest faili sisu kohta. Iga sissekanne kannab sama ``mandatory`` ja ``allowed`` eespool kirjeldatud semantika ja lisab ``marker`` lipu (vaikimisi ``False``): ``marker: True`` deklareerib teed ümbritseva tüübikirje tüübitähisena. :func:`utils.roles.type.get_role_types` kõnnib ``marker: True`` entry; iga marker, mis lahendab rollifailis mittetühja väärtuse, lisab rolli tüübikomplektile ümbritseva tüübi. ``application_id`` jaoks ``application`` ja ``system_service_id`` jaoks ``system-service`` on kanoonilised markerid."

# libretranslate
msgid "``entry-manual-steer.yml`` declares a ``run-name:`` that interpolates the dispatch inputs. Once a run has started, that title is the only record of them: the REST API answers ``inputs: null`` for a workflow_dispatch run. Anything that wants to know what a run was dispatched with therefore parses the title — and parsing it against a hand-copied format would drift the moment the workflow changes, silently and without a failing test."
msgstr "``entry-manual-steer.yml`` kuulutab ``run-name:`` mis interpoleerib lähetussisendeid. Kui jooks on alanud, on see pealkiri nende ainus kirje: REST API vastuseid ``inputs: null`` auks workflow_dispatch jookse. Kõik, mis tahab teada, mis jooksuga saadeti, parsib seega pealkirja - ja parsimine selle vastu käsitsi kopeeritud vormingut triiviks hetkel, mil töövoog muutub, vaikselt ja ilma ebaõnnestunud testita."

# libretranslate
msgid "``ephemeral`` publishes the container port on a host port docker picks, for a service addressed only through the compose network."
msgstr "``ephemeral`` avaldab konteinerpordi hostport docker picks'is teenuse jaoks, mis on adresseeritud ainult komponeerimisvõrgu kaudu."

